window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/owner-courses/b145-ee0c7a4780c06513.json"]={sha256:"ee0c7a4780c06513d090305acf12574cc050ac9a77f40af6e23b975c465b7d30",value:{"id":"b145","title":"潛盾掘進導向控制","titleEn":"TBM alignment guidance and control","category":"underground","kind":"course","status":"guided","contentStatus":"reviewable-educational-curriculum","summary":"本課聚焦把坐標基準、機身姿態與環片幾何連成可獨立查核的導航鏈。沿著調查依據、物理作用、數量估算、現場驗證到工程交接逐項建立可追溯的推論鏈，特別辨別單一數值無法揭露的空間差異及時間效應。以獨立量測檢驗簡化模型，並把觀測結果、教學假設與需要主管工程師審查的決策清楚分列。","summaryEn":"This course focuses on link coordinate datum, machine attitude and ring geometry in an independently checkable navigation chain. It develops a traceable reasoning chain from evidence and physical processes through quantitative estimates, field verification and engineering handover. Spatial variation and time effects are separated from a single nominal result. Independent observations test the simplified models, while measured evidence, teaching assumptions and decisions requiring the responsible engineer remain explicitly distinguished.","scope":"依公開工程原理、官方資料與規範架構編寫的原創教學；步驟是可驗證的學習任務與假想算例，不是設計圖說、施工計畫、開挖、注漿或受限空間作業許可，也不是任何專案的設計文件。數值均為教學假設或公開資料，實際工程須由合格技師依規範與實測資料重新計算並簽證。","scopeEn":"Original teaching built from public engineering principles, official sources and code frameworks. Steps are verifiable learning tasks and hypothetical exercises, not design drawings, method statements, excavation, grouting or confined-space permits, or any project's design documents. Numbers are teaching assumptions or public data; real work must be recalculated and certified by qualified engineers using codes and measured data.","subcategory":"ug-tbm","subcategoryTitle":"潛盾與掘進系統","subcategoryTitleEn":"Shield and tunnel-boring systems","learningTrack":"underground","learningSubdiscipline":"ug-tbm","learningTags":["underground","ug-tbm","tbm"],"architectureFamily":"tbm","architectureNodes":[["控制網與坐標基準","Control networks and coordinate datum"],["陀螺定向與漂移","Gyro orientation and drift"],["設計線形與里程投影","Design alignment and chainage projection"],["尾隙與機器環片相對位移","Relative machine-ring clearance"],["貫通檢核與竣工交接","Breakthrough checks and as-built handover"]],"architectureEdges":[[0,1],[1,2],[2,3],[3,4],[3,1]],"diagram":{"type":"tbm","labels":["控制網與坐標基準","陀螺定向與漂移","設計線形與里程投影","尾隙與機器環片相對位移","貫通檢核與竣工交接"],"labelsEn":["Control networks and coordinate datum","Gyro orientation and drift","Design alignment and chainage projection","Relative machine-ring clearance","Breakthrough checks and as-built handover"],"original":true,"notToScale":true},"workedExample":{"title":"原創假想算例與邊界","titleEn":"Original hypothetical example and boundaries","text":"原創教學算例，所有輸入是為比較機制而假設，並非任何地標的實測資料。以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。假設本地點距轉換原點1000 m，尺度錯誤10 ppm產生10 mm位置差；非儀器隨機誤差。以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。假設視距300 m、角度誤差1.5 arcsec，側向尺度300×1.5/206265=2.18 mm；未含設站誤差。將第一式的一個線性乘數加倍而固定其他邊界，該項貢獻隨之加倍；若為非線性式則必須重新代入，不能等比例外推。把輸入值、單位換算、計算結果及假設列成四欄，再用獨立計算器重算；最後比較量測誤差與模型簡化，判斷改變是否足以支持工程決策。","textEn":"Original teaching example: all inputs are assumptions for comparing mechanisms, not measurements from a landmark project. The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings. At an assumed distance 1000 m from a transformation origin, a 10 ppm scale error creates 10 mm position error, not random instrument noise. The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings. Assume sight distance 300 m and angular error 1.5 arcsec; lateral scale is 300×1.5/206265=2.18 mm, excluding station error. Doubling one linear multiplicative input in the first relation while holding the remaining boundaries fixed doubles that contribution; a nonlinear relation must instead be evaluated again. Tabulate inputs, unit conversions, results and assumptions in separate columns, and recalculate independently. Finally compare measurement uncertainty with model simplification before deciding whether the difference supports an engineering decision.","assumptions":"數值是本課自行設定的教學假設，不代表任何專案的設計值、量測值或規範允許值；改變系統邊界或荷載組合後必須重算。","assumptionsEn":"Inputs are teaching assumptions, not any project's design values, measurements or code allowances; recalculate after changing the system boundary or load combination.","sourceScope":"原創數值練習；來源支援公開原理與工程背景，不宣稱來源提供這組數據。","sourceScopeEn":"Original numerical exercise; sources support public principles and project context, not these numbers."},"depth":5,"languageCoverage":["zh-TW","en"],"simulationOnly":true,"educationEdition":14,"enrichmentVersion":14,"stages":[{"id":"b145-v14-s1","title":"地層條件、邊界與工程系統","titleEn":"Ground conditions, boundaries and engineering system","description":"本階段聚焦「控制網與坐標基準」與「方位精度與遠距傳遞」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Control networks and coordinate datum\" and \"Azimuth precision over distance\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b145-v14-01","title":"控制網與坐標基準：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Control networks and coordinate datum: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"prerequisiteIds":[],"objective":"說明「控制網與坐標基準」如何影響潛盾掘進導向控制的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Control networks and coordinate datum” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “TBM alignment guidance and control”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"隧道導航從地表控制延伸到洞內測站再到機器目標，任何基準轉換錯誤都會沿鏈傳遞。坐標系、軸向、單位及高程需在同一版本，畫面上的小偏差只有在基準正確時才有意義。 假設本地點距轉換原點1000 m，尺度錯誤10 ppm產生10 mm位置差；非儀器隨機誤差。 原點吻合但尺度或旋轉錯誤可在長距離逐步放大，施工前段看似正常後段才偏離；若更換坐標版本未通知設備端，導航顯示會產生假跳動。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「控制網與坐標基準」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Navigation transfers surface control through underground stations to machine targets, propagating datum errors along the chain. Coordinate frame, axes, units and elevation must share a version; small displayed offsets matter only within the correct datum. At an assumed distance 1000 m from a transformation origin, a 10 ppm scale error creates 10 mm position error, not random instrument noise. A matching origin with wrong scale or rotation diverges over distance, appearing normal early and failing later. An uncommunicated datum revision can also create a false jump on the navigation display. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Control networks and coordinate datum” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings.","failure":"常見誤解：「坐標原點重合就保證整條長隧道的尺度與旋轉都正確。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Coincident coordinate origins guarantee correct scale and rotation along the entire long tunnel.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「控制網與坐標基準」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Control networks and coordinate datum”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b145-v14-01-k1","title":"控制網與坐標基準","titleEn":"Control networks and coordinate datum","text":"隧道導航從地表控制延伸到洞內測站再到機器目標，任何基準轉換錯誤都會沿鏈傳遞。坐標系、軸向、單位及高程需在同一版本，畫面上的小偏差只有在基準正確時才有意義。","textEn":"Navigation transfers surface control through underground stations to machine targets, propagating datum errors along the chain. Coordinate frame, axes, units and elevation must share a version; small displayed offsets matter only within the correct datum.","sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]},{"id":"b145-v14-01-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：坐標原點重合就保證整條長隧道的尺度與旋轉都正確。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Coincident coordinate origins guarantee correct scale and rotation along the entire long tunnel. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「控制網與坐標基準」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Control networks and coordinate datum\" is correct?","options":["坐標原點重合就保證整條長隧道的尺度與旋轉都正確。","隧道導航從地表控制延伸到洞內測站再到機器目標，任何基準轉換錯誤都會沿鏈傳遞。","每一測段的角度誤差必定獨立而且可以互相抵消。"],"optionsEn":["Coincident coordinate origins guarantee correct scale and rotation along the entire long tunnel.","Navigation transfers surface control through underground stations to machine targets, propagating datum errors along the chain.","Angular errors in every survey segment are necessarily independent and cancel each other."],"answer":1,"explanation":"隧道導航從地表控制延伸到洞內測站再到機器目標，任何基準轉換錯誤都會沿鏈傳遞。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Navigation transfers surface control through underground stations to machine targets, propagating datum errors along the chain. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":1},{"id":"b145-v14-02","title":"控制網與坐標基準：定量估算","titleEn":"Control networks and coordinate datum: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"prerequisiteIds":["b145-v14-01"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「控制網與坐標基準」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Control networks and coordinate datum” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。假設本地點距轉換原點1000 m，尺度錯誤10 ppm產生10 mm位置差；非儀器隨機誤差。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings. At an assumed distance 1000 m from a transformation origin, a 10 ppm scale error creates 10 mm position error, not random instrument noise. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：以獨立控制點檢查坐標轉換、尺度和高程，保存轉換矩陣與版本；測量主管須確認設計線形、機器與竣工資料使用同一基準，不能只比對某一重合原點。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Check transformations, scale and elevation at independent controls and retain matrices and versions; the survey lead confirms a common datum for design alignment, machine and as-built data rather than checking one coincident origin alone.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b145-v14-02-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。假設本地點距轉換原點1000 m，尺度錯誤10 ppm產生10 mm位置差；非儀器隨機誤差。","textEn":"The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings. At an assumed distance 1000 m from a transformation origin, a 10 ppm scale error creates 10 mm position error, not random instrument noise.","sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]},{"id":"b145-v14-02-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「控制網與坐標基準」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Control networks and coordinate datum\", which statement holds?","options":["從目標點算刀盤中心只需平移，不必考慮機身旋轉。","只要能回到設計中心線，就不必檢查組環曲率與止水限制。","以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。"],"optionsEn":["Transforming a target to cutterhead center requires translation only, without machine rotation.","Returning to the design centerline removes the need to check ring curvature and seal limits.","The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings."],"answer":2,"explanation":"以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":2},{"id":"b145-v14-03","title":"控制網與坐標基準：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Control networks and coordinate datum: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"prerequisiteIds":["b145-v14-02"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「控制網與坐標基準」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Control networks and coordinate datum” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"以獨立控制點檢查坐標轉換、尺度和高程，保存轉換矩陣與版本；測量主管須確認設計線形、機器與竣工資料使用同一基準，不能只比對某一重合原點。驗證亦須釐清下列替代解釋：原點吻合但尺度或旋轉錯誤可在長距離逐步放大，施工前段看似正常後段才偏離；若更換坐標版本未通知設備端，導航顯示會產生假跳動。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Check transformations, scale and elevation at independent controls and retain matrices and versions; the survey lead confirms a common datum for design alignment, machine and as-built data rather than checking one coincident origin alone. Verification must also resolve this competing explanation: A matching origin with wrong scale or rotation diverges over distance, appearing normal early and failing later. An uncommunicated datum revision can also create a false jump on the navigation display. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：交接時逐項記錄控制網與坐標基準的資料來源與適用條件。以獨立控制點檢查坐標轉換、尺度和高程，保存轉換矩陣與版本；測量主管須確認設計線形、機器與竣工資料使用同一基準，不能只比對某一重合原點。","observationEn":"Site practice: At handover, document the evidence and applicable conditions for control networks and coordinate datum. Check transformations, scale and elevation at independent controls and retain matrices and versions; the survey lead confirms a common datum for design alignment, machine and as-built data rather than checking one coincident origin alone.","failure":"注意干擾：原點吻合但尺度或旋轉錯誤可在長距離逐步放大，施工前段看似正常後段才偏離；若更換坐標版本未通知設備端，導航顯示會產生假跳動。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: A matching origin with wrong scale or rotation diverges over distance, appearing normal early and failing later. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b145-v14-03-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以獨立控制點檢查坐標轉換、尺度和高程，保存轉換矩陣與版本；測量主管須確認設計線形、機器與竣工資料使用同一基準，不能只比對某一重合原點。驗證亦須釐清下列替代解釋：原點吻合但尺度或旋轉錯誤可在長距離逐步放大，施工前段看似正常後段才偏離；若更換坐標版本未通知設備端，導航顯示會產生假跳動。","textEn":"Check transformations, scale and elevation at independent controls and retain matrices and versions; the survey lead confirms a common datum for design alignment, machine and as-built data rather than checking one coincident origin alone. Verification must also resolve this competing explanation: A matching origin with wrong scale or rotation diverges over distance, appearing normal early and failing later. An uncommunicated datum revision can also create a false jump on the navigation display.","sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]},{"id":"b145-v14-03-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"交接時逐項記錄控制網與坐標基準的資料來源與適用條件。以獨立控制點檢查坐標轉換、尺度和高程，保存轉換矩陣與版本；測量主管須確認設計線形、機器與竣工資料使用同一基準，不能只比對某一重合原點。","textEn":"At handover, document the evidence and applicable conditions for control networks and coordinate datum. Check transformations, scale and elevation at independent controls and retain matrices and versions; the survey lead confirms a common datum for design alignment, machine and as-built data rather than checking one coincident origin alone.","sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「控制網與坐標基準」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Control networks and coordinate datum\"?","options":["以獨立控制點檢查坐標轉換、尺度和高程，保存轉換矩陣與版本；測量主管須確認設計線形、機器與竣工資料使用同一基準，不能只比對某一重合原點。","量測時不必記錄溫度、水頭、開挖序列與施工荷重，因為它們不會影響結果。","把受折射影響的讀值平滑後就能恢復真實機器姿態。"],"optionsEn":["Check transformations, scale and elevation at independent controls and retain matrices and versions.","Temperature, water head, excavation sequence and construction loads need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","Smoothing refracted observations restores the true machine attitude automatically."],"answer":0,"explanation":"以獨立控制點檢查坐標轉換、尺度和高程，保存轉換矩陣與版本；測量主管須確認設計線形、機器與竣工資料使用同一基準，不能只比對某一重合原點。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Check transformations, scale and elevation at independent controls and retain matrices and versions; the survey lead confirms a common datum for design alignment, machine and as-built data rather than checking one coincident origin alone. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":3},{"id":"b145-v14-04","title":"控制網與坐標基準：失效診斷","titleEn":"Control networks and coordinate datum: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"prerequisiteIds":["b145-v14-03"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「控制網與坐標基準」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Control networks and coordinate datum” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"原點吻合但尺度或旋轉錯誤可在長距離逐步放大，施工前段看似正常後段才偏離；若更換坐標版本未通知設備端，導航顯示會產生假跳動。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"A matching origin with wrong scale or rotation diverges over distance, appearing normal early and failing later. An uncommunicated datum revision can also create a false jump on the navigation display. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：原點吻合但尺度或旋轉錯誤可在長距離逐步放大，施工前段看似正常後段才偏離；若更換坐標版本未通知設備端，導航顯示會產生假跳動。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: An uncommunicated datum revision can also create a false jump on the navigation display.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「坐標原點重合就保證整條長隧道的尺度與旋轉都正確。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Coincident coordinate origins guarantee correct scale and rotation along the entire long tunnel.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b145-v14-04-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"原點吻合但尺度或旋轉錯誤可在長距離逐步放大，施工前段看似正常後段才偏離；若更換坐標版本未通知設備端，導航顯示會產生假跳動。","textEn":"A matching origin with wrong scale or rotation diverges over distance, appearing normal early and failing later. An uncommunicated datum revision can also create a false jump on the navigation display.","sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]},{"id":"b145-v14-04-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「控制網與坐標基準」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Control networks and coordinate datum\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自施工人員失誤，設計與細部不需要檢討。","原點吻合但尺度或旋轉錯誤可在長距離逐步放大，施工前段看似正常後段才偏離；若更換坐標版本未通知設備端，導航顯示會產生假跳動。","每一測段的角度誤差必定獨立而且可以互相抵消。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is a workmanship error, so design and detailing never need review.","A matching origin with wrong scale or rotation diverges over distance, appearing normal early and failing later.","Angular errors in every survey segment are necessarily independent and cancel each other."],"answer":1,"explanation":"原點吻合但尺度或旋轉錯誤可在長距離逐步放大，施工前段看似正常後段才偏離；若更換坐標版本未通知設備端，導航顯示會產生假跳動。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A matching origin with wrong scale or rotation diverges over distance, appearing normal early and failing later. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":4},{"id":"b145-v14-05","title":"方位精度與遠距傳遞：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Azimuth precision over distance: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"prerequisiteIds":["b145-v14-04"],"objective":"說明「方位精度與遠距傳遞」如何影響潛盾掘進導向控制的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Azimuth precision over distance” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “TBM alignment guidance and control”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"長隧道方向誤差會隨距離放大，角度精度與位置精度必須分別規劃。多次測站轉接可能累積相關偏差，單次儀器精度不能直接當作全線貫通精度，需用網平差和獨立方向控制。 假設視距300 m、角度誤差1.5 arcsec，側向尺度300×1.5/206265=2.18 mm；未含設站誤差。 對中誤差或折射若總朝同一側會形成系統曲線偏差，增加相同幾何的測次未必改善；忽略共同偏差可能得到過度樂觀的貫通估計。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「方位精度與遠距傳遞」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Angular error grows into lateral position error along a long tunnel. Repeated station transfers can accumulate correlated bias, so one instrument rating is not a breakthrough-accuracy estimate; network adjustment and independent orientation are required. Assume sight distance 300 m and angular error 1.5 arcsec; lateral scale is 300×1.5/206265=2.18 mm, excluding station error. Consistently directed centering or refraction creates systematic alignment drift that repeating identical geometry may not reduce. Ignoring common bias produces an overly optimistic estimate of eventual breakthrough accuracy. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Azimuth precision over distance” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings.","failure":"常見誤解：「每一測段的角度誤差必定獨立而且可以互相抵消。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Angular errors in every survey segment are necessarily independent and cancel each other.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「方位精度與遠距傳遞」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Azimuth precision over distance”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b145-v14-05-k1","title":"方位精度與遠距傳遞","titleEn":"Azimuth precision over distance","text":"長隧道方向誤差會隨距離放大，角度精度與位置精度必須分別規劃。多次測站轉接可能累積相關偏差，單次儀器精度不能直接當作全線貫通精度，需用網平差和獨立方向控制。","textEn":"Angular error grows into lateral position error along a long tunnel. Repeated station transfers can accumulate correlated bias, so one instrument rating is not a breakthrough-accuracy estimate; network adjustment and independent orientation are required.","sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]},{"id":"b145-v14-05-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：每一測段的角度誤差必定獨立而且可以互相抵消。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Angular errors in every survey segment are necessarily independent and cancel each other. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「方位精度與遠距傳遞」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Azimuth precision over distance\" is correct?","options":["每一測段的角度誤差必定獨立而且可以互相抵消。","陀螺方向是自動真值，不需再校準或考慮溫度漂移。","長隧道方向誤差會隨距離放大，角度精度與位置精度必須分別規劃。"],"optionsEn":["Angular errors in every survey segment are necessarily independent and cancel each other.","Gyro orientation is automatic truth needing no calibration or thermal-drift consideration.","Angular error grows into lateral position error along a long tunnel."],"answer":2,"explanation":"長隧道方向誤差會隨距離放大，角度精度與位置精度必須分別規劃。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Angular error grows into lateral position error along a long tunnel. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":5},{"id":"b145-v14-06","title":"方位精度與遠距傳遞：定量估算","titleEn":"Azimuth precision over distance: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"prerequisiteIds":["b145-v14-05"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「方位精度與遠距傳遞」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Azimuth precision over distance” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。假設視距300 m、角度誤差1.5 arcsec，側向尺度300×1.5/206265=2.18 mm；未含設站誤差。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings. Assume sight distance 300 m and angular error 1.5 arcsec; lateral scale is 300×1.5/206265=2.18 mm, excluding station error. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：以正倒鏡、多測回及獨立方向基準核對方位，將設站、對中與角度不確定分項傳播；測量工程師應檢查相關性，不能把每測段誤差都當互相抵消。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Check azimuth with face reversals, repeated sets and independent direction references, propagating station, centering and angular uncertainties separately; survey engineers assess correlation rather than assuming segment errors cancel each other.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b145-v14-06-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。假設視距300 m、角度誤差1.5 arcsec，側向尺度300×1.5/206265=2.18 mm；未含設站誤差。","textEn":"The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings. Assume sight distance 300 m and angular error 1.5 arcsec; lateral scale is 300×1.5/206265=2.18 mm, excluding station error.","sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]},{"id":"b145-v14-06-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「方位精度與遠距傳遞」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Azimuth precision over distance\", which statement holds?","options":["以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。","平面里程和斜距可以不加說明直接用在同一環號表。","刀盤在設計線上就代表盾尾與已安裝環片必定同心。"],"optionsEn":["The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings.","Horizontal chainage and slope distance can be interchanged within one ring table without explanation.","A cutterhead on the design alignment guarantees concentric shield tail and installed rings."],"answer":0,"explanation":"以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":6},{"id":"b145-v14-07","title":"方位精度與遠距傳遞：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Azimuth precision over distance: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"prerequisiteIds":["b145-v14-06"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「方位精度與遠距傳遞」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Azimuth precision over distance” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"以正倒鏡、多測回及獨立方向基準核對方位，將設站、對中與角度不確定分項傳播；測量工程師應檢查相關性，不能把每測段誤差都當互相抵消。驗證亦須釐清下列替代解釋：對中誤差或折射若總朝同一側會形成系統曲線偏差，增加相同幾何的測次未必改善；忽略共同偏差可能得到過度樂觀的貫通估計。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Check azimuth with face reversals, repeated sets and independent direction references, propagating station, centering and angular uncertainties separately; survey engineers assess correlation rather than assuming segment errors cancel each other. Verification must also resolve this competing explanation: Consistently directed centering or refraction creates systematic alignment drift that repeating identical geometry may not reduce. Ignoring common bias produces an overly optimistic estimate of eventual breakthrough accuracy. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：交接時逐項記錄方位精度與遠距傳遞的資料來源與適用條件。以正倒鏡、多測回及獨立方向基準核對方位，將設站、對中與角度不確定分項傳播；測量工程師應檢查相關性，不能把每測段誤差都當互相抵消。","observationEn":"Site practice: At handover, document the evidence and applicable conditions for azimuth precision over distance. Check azimuth with face reversals, repeated sets and independent direction references, propagating station, centering and angular uncertainties separately; survey engineers assess correlation rather than assuming segment errors cancel each other.","failure":"注意干擾：對中誤差或折射若總朝同一側會形成系統曲線偏差，增加相同幾何的測次未必改善；忽略共同偏差可能得到過度樂觀的貫通估計。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Consistently directed centering or refraction creates systematic alignment drift that repeating identical geometry may not reduce. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b145-v14-07-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以正倒鏡、多測回及獨立方向基準核對方位，將設站、對中與角度不確定分項傳播；測量工程師應檢查相關性，不能把每測段誤差都當互相抵消。驗證亦須釐清下列替代解釋：對中誤差或折射若總朝同一側會形成系統曲線偏差，增加相同幾何的測次未必改善；忽略共同偏差可能得到過度樂觀的貫通估計。","textEn":"Check azimuth with face reversals, repeated sets and independent direction references, propagating station, centering and angular uncertainties separately; survey engineers assess correlation rather than assuming segment errors cancel each other. Verification must also resolve this competing explanation: Consistently directed centering or refraction creates systematic alignment drift that repeating identical geometry may not reduce. Ignoring common bias produces an overly optimistic estimate of eventual breakthrough accuracy.","sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]},{"id":"b145-v14-07-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"交接時逐項記錄方位精度與遠距傳遞的資料來源與適用條件。以正倒鏡、多測回及獨立方向基準核對方位，將設站、對中與角度不確定分項傳播；測量工程師應檢查相關性，不能把每測段誤差都當互相抵消。","textEn":"At handover, document the evidence and applicable conditions for azimuth precision over distance. Check azimuth with face reversals, repeated sets and independent direction references, propagating station, centering and angular uncertainties separately; survey engineers assess correlation rather than assuming segment errors cancel each other.","sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「方位精度與遠距傳遞」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Azimuth precision over distance\"?","options":["沿用另一條隧道或另一處地層的量測結果，就可視為本工程已完成驗證。","以正倒鏡、多測回及獨立方向基準核對方位，將設站、對中與角度不確定分項傳播；測量工程師應檢查相關性，不能把每測段誤差都當互相抵消。","兩個共用錯誤基準的感測器融合後可以消除共同偏差。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another tunnel or ground formation counts as verifying this structure.","Check azimuth with face reversals, repeated sets and independent direction references, propagating station, centering and angular uncertainties separately.","Fusing two sensors sharing an incorrect datum eliminates their common bias."],"answer":1,"explanation":"以正倒鏡、多測回及獨立方向基準核對方位，將設站、對中與角度不確定分項傳播；測量工程師應檢查相關性，不能把每測段誤差都當互相抵消。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Check azimuth with face reversals, repeated sets and independent direction references, propagating station, centering and angular uncertainties separately; survey engineers assess correlation rather than assuming segment errors cancel each other. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":7},{"id":"b145-v14-08","title":"方位精度與遠距傳遞：失效診斷","titleEn":"Azimuth precision over distance: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"prerequisiteIds":["b145-v14-07"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「方位精度與遠距傳遞」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Azimuth precision over distance” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"對中誤差或折射若總朝同一側會形成系統曲線偏差，增加相同幾何的測次未必改善；忽略共同偏差可能得到過度樂觀的貫通估計。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Consistently directed centering or refraction creates systematic alignment drift that repeating identical geometry may not reduce. Ignoring common bias produces an overly optimistic estimate of eventual breakthrough accuracy. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：對中誤差或折射若總朝同一側會形成系統曲線偏差，增加相同幾何的測次未必改善；忽略共同偏差可能得到過度樂觀的貫通估計。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Ignoring common bias produces an overly optimistic estimate of eventual breakthrough accuracy.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「每一測段的角度誤差必定獨立而且可以互相抵消。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Angular errors in every survey segment are necessarily independent and cancel each other.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b145-v14-08-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"對中誤差或折射若總朝同一側會形成系統曲線偏差，增加相同幾何的測次未必改善；忽略共同偏差可能得到過度樂觀的貫通估計。","textEn":"Consistently directed centering or refraction creates systematic alignment drift that repeating identical geometry may not reduce. Ignoring common bias produces an overly optimistic estimate of eventual breakthrough accuracy.","sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]},{"id":"b145-v14-08-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「方位精度與遠距傳遞」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Azimuth precision over distance\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["補一層塗料或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數劣化問題。","陀螺方向是自動真值，不需再校準或考慮溫度漂移。","對中誤差或折射若總朝同一側會形成系統曲線偏差，增加相同幾何的測次未必改善；忽略共同偏差可能得到過度樂觀的貫通估計。"],"optionsEn":["Adding a coat of paint or widening the acceptance limits solves most deterioration problems.","Gyro orientation is automatic truth needing no calibration or thermal-drift consideration.","Consistently directed centering or refraction creates systematic alignment drift that repeating identical geometry may not reduce."],"answer":2,"explanation":"對中誤差或折射若總朝同一側會形成系統曲線偏差，增加相同幾何的測次未必改善；忽略共同偏差可能得到過度樂觀的貫通估計。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Consistently directed centering or refraction creates systematic alignment drift that repeating identical geometry may not reduce. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":8}],"order":1},{"id":"b145-v14-s2","title":"機制、材料與定量設計","titleEn":"Mechanisms, materials and quantitative design","description":"本階段聚焦「陀螺定向與漂移」與「目標桿臂與機身姿態」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Gyro orientation and drift\" and \"Target lever arms and machine attitude\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b145-v14-09","title":"陀螺定向與漂移：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Gyro orientation and drift: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"prerequisiteIds":["b145-v14-08"],"objective":"說明「陀螺定向與漂移」如何影響潛盾掘進導向控制的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Gyro orientation and drift” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “TBM alignment guidance and control”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"陀螺提供不依賴長視線的方向資訊，但仍需校準、溫度與時間穩定性檢查。它不是自動真值，應與光學控制形成獨立比較，並辨識兩者是否共享同一坐標轉換偏差。 假設方向偏差0.001 rad，在100 m投影造成約100 mm側移；小角近似e=Lθ。 校準基線若本身錯誤，陀螺和後續資料可能一致卻共同偏轉；未保存漂移歷程又會把溫度效應誤判成機器實際轉向。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「陀螺定向與漂移」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Gyro orientation avoids dependence on a long sight line but still requires calibration and thermal and temporal checks. It is not automatic truth; compare it independently with optical control while identifying any shared datum bias. Assume direction bias 0.001 rad; projection over 100 m gives approximately 100 mm lateral error through e=Lθ. A faulty calibration baseline makes subsequent gyro observations consistently wrong, while missing drift history allows thermal effects to masquerade as actual steering. Agreement within that shared chain does not establish correctness. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Gyro orientation and drift” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings.","failure":"常見誤解：「陀螺方向是自動真值，不需再校準或考慮溫度漂移。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Gyro orientation is automatic truth needing no calibration or thermal-drift consideration.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「陀螺定向與漂移」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Gyro orientation and drift”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b145-v14-09-k1","title":"陀螺定向與漂移","titleEn":"Gyro orientation and drift","text":"陀螺提供不依賴長視線的方向資訊，但仍需校準、溫度與時間穩定性檢查。它不是自動真值，應與光學控制形成獨立比較，並辨識兩者是否共享同一坐標轉換偏差。","textEn":"Gyro orientation avoids dependence on a long sight line but still requires calibration and thermal and temporal checks. It is not automatic truth; compare it independently with optical control while identifying any shared datum bias.","sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]},{"id":"b145-v14-09-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：陀螺方向是自動真值，不需再校準或考慮溫度漂移。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Gyro orientation is automatic truth needing no calibration or thermal-drift consideration. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「陀螺定向與漂移」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Gyro orientation and drift\" is correct?","options":["陀螺提供不依賴長視線的方向資訊，但仍需校準、溫度與時間穩定性檢查。","陀螺方向是自動真值，不需再校準或考慮溫度漂移。","從目標點算刀盤中心只需平移，不必考慮機身旋轉。"],"optionsEn":["Gyro orientation avoids dependence on a long sight line but still requires calibration and thermal and temporal checks.","Gyro orientation is automatic truth needing no calibration or thermal-drift consideration.","Transforming a target to cutterhead center requires translation only, without machine rotation."],"answer":0,"explanation":"陀螺提供不依賴長視線的方向資訊，但仍需校準、溫度與時間穩定性檢查。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Gyro orientation avoids dependence on a long sight line but still requires calibration and thermal and temporal checks. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":9},{"id":"b145-v14-10","title":"陀螺定向與漂移：定量估算","titleEn":"Gyro orientation and drift: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"prerequisiteIds":["b145-v14-09"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「陀螺定向與漂移」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Gyro orientation and drift” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。假設方向偏差0.001 rad，在100 m投影造成約100 mm側移；小角近似e=Lθ。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings. Assume direction bias 0.001 rad; projection over 100 m gives approximately 100 mm lateral error through e=Lθ. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：在已知方位基線做前後校驗，保留儀器溫度、觀測時間與漂移修正；比較陀螺和光學差值隨時間變化，超出核准不確定範圍時先查量測鏈，不自行選較順眼結果。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Calibrate before and after on a known azimuth and retain temperature, time and drift corrections; track gyro-optical disagreement and investigate the chain outside approved uncertainty rather than selecting the more convenient result.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b145-v14-10-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。假設方向偏差0.001 rad，在100 m投影造成約100 mm側移；小角近似e=Lθ。","textEn":"The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings. Assume direction bias 0.001 rad; projection over 100 m gives approximately 100 mm lateral error through e=Lθ.","sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]},{"id":"b145-v14-10-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「陀螺定向與漂移」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Gyro orientation and drift\", which statement holds?","options":["只要能回到設計中心線，就不必檢查組環曲率與止水限制。","以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。","把受折射影響的讀值平滑後就能恢復真實機器姿態。"],"optionsEn":["Returning to the design centerline removes the need to check ring curvature and seal limits.","The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings.","Smoothing refracted observations restores the true machine attitude automatically."],"answer":1,"explanation":"以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":10},{"id":"b145-v14-11","title":"陀螺定向與漂移：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Gyro orientation and drift: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"prerequisiteIds":["b145-v14-10"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「陀螺定向與漂移」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Gyro orientation and drift” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"在已知方位基線做前後校驗，保留儀器溫度、觀測時間與漂移修正；比較陀螺和光學差值隨時間變化，超出核准不確定範圍時先查量測鏈，不自行選較順眼結果。驗證亦須釐清下列替代解釋：校準基線若本身錯誤，陀螺和後續資料可能一致卻共同偏轉；未保存漂移歷程又會把溫度效應誤判成機器實際轉向。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Calibrate before and after on a known azimuth and retain temperature, time and drift corrections; track gyro-optical disagreement and investigate the chain outside approved uncertainty rather than selecting the more convenient result. Verification must also resolve this competing explanation: A faulty calibration baseline makes subsequent gyro observations consistently wrong, while missing drift history allows thermal effects to masquerade as actual steering. Agreement within that shared chain does not establish correctness. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：交接時逐項記錄陀螺定向與漂移的資料來源與適用條件。在已知方位基線做前後校驗，保留儀器溫度、觀測時間與漂移修正；比較陀螺和光學差值隨時間變化，超出核准不確定範圍時先查量測鏈，不自行選較順眼結果。","observationEn":"Site practice: At handover, document the evidence and applicable conditions for gyro orientation and drift. Calibrate before and after on a known azimuth and retain temperature, time and drift corrections; track gyro-optical disagreement and investigate the chain outside approved uncertainty rather than selecting the more convenient result.","failure":"注意干擾：校準基線若本身錯誤，陀螺和後續資料可能一致卻共同偏轉；未保存漂移歷程又會把溫度效應誤判成機器實際轉向。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: A faulty calibration baseline makes subsequent gyro observations consistently wrong, while missing drift history allows thermal effects to masquerade as actual steering. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b145-v14-11-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"在已知方位基線做前後校驗，保留儀器溫度、觀測時間與漂移修正；比較陀螺和光學差值隨時間變化，超出核准不確定範圍時先查量測鏈，不自行選較順眼結果。驗證亦須釐清下列替代解釋：校準基線若本身錯誤，陀螺和後續資料可能一致卻共同偏轉；未保存漂移歷程又會把溫度效應誤判成機器實際轉向。","textEn":"Calibrate before and after on a known azimuth and retain temperature, time and drift corrections; track gyro-optical disagreement and investigate the chain outside approved uncertainty rather than selecting the more convenient result. Verification must also resolve this competing explanation: A faulty calibration baseline makes subsequent gyro observations consistently wrong, while missing drift history allows thermal effects to masquerade as actual steering. Agreement within that shared chain does not establish correctness.","sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]},{"id":"b145-v14-11-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"交接時逐項記錄陀螺定向與漂移的資料來源與適用條件。在已知方位基線做前後校驗，保留儀器溫度、觀測時間與漂移修正；比較陀螺和光學差值隨時間變化，超出核准不確定範圍時先查量測鏈，不自行選較順眼結果。","textEn":"At handover, document the evidence and applicable conditions for gyro orientation and drift. Calibrate before and after on a known azimuth and retain temperature, time and drift corrections; track gyro-optical disagreement and investigate the chain outside approved uncertainty rather than selecting the more convenient result.","sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「陀螺定向與漂移」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Gyro orientation and drift\"?","options":["只看一次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準點、參考試體或重複量測。","事後強制閉合差歸零，就不需要再保存原始貫通誤差。","在已知方位基線做前後校驗，保留儀器溫度、觀測時間與漂移修正；比較陀螺和光學差值隨時間變化，超出核准不確定範圍時先查量測鏈，不自行選較順眼結果。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the work; no datum, reference specimen or repeat measurement is needed.","Forcing closure to zero afterward removes any need to retain the original breakthrough discrepancy.","Calibrate before and after on a known azimuth and retain temperature, time and drift corrections."],"answer":2,"explanation":"在已知方位基線做前後校驗，保留儀器溫度、觀測時間與漂移修正；比較陀螺和光學差值隨時間變化，超出核准不確定範圍時先查量測鏈，不自行選較順眼結果。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Calibrate before and after on a known azimuth and retain temperature, time and drift corrections; track gyro-optical disagreement and investigate the chain outside approved uncertainty rather than selecting the more convenient result. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":11},{"id":"b145-v14-12","title":"陀螺定向與漂移：失效診斷","titleEn":"Gyro orientation and drift: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"prerequisiteIds":["b145-v14-11"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「陀螺定向與漂移」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Gyro orientation and drift” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"校準基線若本身錯誤，陀螺和後續資料可能一致卻共同偏轉；未保存漂移歷程又會把溫度效應誤判成機器實際轉向。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"A faulty calibration baseline makes subsequent gyro observations consistently wrong, while missing drift history allows thermal effects to masquerade as actual steering. Agreement within that shared chain does not establish correctness. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：校準基線若本身錯誤，陀螺和後續資料可能一致卻共同偏轉；未保存漂移歷程又會把溫度效應誤判成機器實際轉向。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Agreement within that shared chain does not establish correctness.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「陀螺方向是自動真值，不需再校準或考慮溫度漂移。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Gyro orientation is automatic truth needing no calibration or thermal-drift consideration.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b145-v14-12-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"校準基線若本身錯誤，陀螺和後續資料可能一致卻共同偏轉；未保存漂移歷程又會把溫度效應誤判成機器實際轉向。","textEn":"A faulty calibration baseline makes subsequent gyro observations consistently wrong, while missing drift history allows thermal effects to masquerade as actual steering. Agreement within that shared chain does not establish correctness.","sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]},{"id":"b145-v14-12-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「陀螺定向與漂移」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Gyro orientation and drift\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["校準基線若本身錯誤，陀螺和後續資料可能一致卻共同偏轉；未保存漂移歷程又會把溫度效應誤判成機器實際轉向。","裂縫或異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","從目標點算刀盤中心只需平移，不必考慮機身旋轉。"],"optionsEn":["A faulty calibration baseline makes subsequent gyro observations consistently wrong, while missing drift history allows thermal effects to masquerade as actual steering.","A crack or anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","Transforming a target to cutterhead center requires translation only, without machine rotation."],"answer":0,"explanation":"校準基線若本身錯誤，陀螺和後續資料可能一致卻共同偏轉；未保存漂移歷程又會把溫度效應誤判成機器實際轉向。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A faulty calibration baseline makes subsequent gyro observations consistently wrong, while missing drift history allows thermal effects to masquerade as actual steering. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":12},{"id":"b145-v14-13","title":"目標桿臂與機身姿態：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Target lever arms and machine attitude: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"prerequisiteIds":["b145-v14-12"],"objective":"說明「目標桿臂與機身姿態」如何影響潛盾掘進導向控制的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Target lever arms and machine attitude” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “TBM alignment guidance and control”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"導航量到的是目標點，再透過機身幾何換算刀盤中心與軸線。俯仰、偏航與滾轉都會影響桿臂投影，目標安裝後移位或模型版本錯誤，即使測量本身準確也會顯示錯誤機位。 假設目標距刀盤中心10 m、偏航0.1°，橫向桿臂修正10sin0.1°=17.45 mm；非可忽略常數。 只做平移而漏掉旋轉會使長桿臂偏差放大，目標支架鬆動又可能被控制系統當成機器偏離；追逐錯誤導航訊號會造成真實線形修正過度。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「目標桿臂與機身姿態」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Navigation observes targets and transforms them through machine geometry to the cutterhead and axis. Pitch, yaw and roll alter lever-arm projection; a moved target or wrong geometry version creates incorrect machine position despite accurate measurement. Assume target-to-cutterhead lever arm 10 m and yaw 0.1°; lateral correction is 10sin0.1°=17.45 mm, not a negligible constant. Applying translation without rotation amplifies long-lever errors, while a loose target bracket can mimic machine deviation. Steering in response to that false signal creates real overcorrection of the alignment. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Target lever arms and machine attitude” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings.","failure":"常見誤解：「從目標點算刀盤中心只需平移，不必考慮機身旋轉。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Transforming a target to cutterhead center requires translation only, without machine rotation.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「目標桿臂與機身姿態」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Target lever arms and machine attitude”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b145-v14-13-k1","title":"目標桿臂與機身姿態","titleEn":"Target lever arms and machine attitude","text":"導航量到的是目標點，再透過機身幾何換算刀盤中心與軸線。俯仰、偏航與滾轉都會影響桿臂投影，目標安裝後移位或模型版本錯誤，即使測量本身準確也會顯示錯誤機位。","textEn":"Navigation observes targets and transforms them through machine geometry to the cutterhead and axis. Pitch, yaw and roll alter lever-arm projection; a moved target or wrong geometry version creates incorrect machine position despite accurate measurement.","sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]},{"id":"b145-v14-13-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：從目標點算刀盤中心只需平移，不必考慮機身旋轉。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Transforming a target to cutterhead center requires translation only, without machine rotation. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「目標桿臂與機身姿態」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Target lever arms and machine attitude\" is correct?","options":["從目標點算刀盤中心只需平移，不必考慮機身旋轉。","導航量到的是目標點，再透過機身幾何換算刀盤中心與軸線。","平面里程和斜距可以不加說明直接用在同一環號表。"],"optionsEn":["Transforming a target to cutterhead center requires translation only, without machine rotation.","Navigation observes targets and transforms them through machine geometry to the cutterhead and axis.","Horizontal chainage and slope distance can be interchanged within one ring table without explanation."],"answer":1,"explanation":"導航量到的是目標點，再透過機身幾何換算刀盤中心與軸線。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Navigation observes targets and transforms them through machine geometry to the cutterhead and axis. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":13},{"id":"b145-v14-14","title":"目標桿臂與機身姿態：定量估算","titleEn":"Target lever arms and machine attitude: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"prerequisiteIds":["b145-v14-13"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「目標桿臂與機身姿態」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Target lever arms and machine attitude” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。假設目標距刀盤中心10 m、偏航0.1°，橫向桿臂修正10sin0.1°=17.45 mm；非可忽略常數。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings. Assume target-to-cutterhead lever arm 10 m and yaw 0.1°; lateral correction is 10sin0.1°=17.45 mm, not a negligible constant. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：以獨立機身基準量測目標位置，核對三維旋轉順序與單位，維修後重新查驗；將顯示刀盤坐標與外部測量比較，設備和測量主管共同確認幾何模型版本。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Independently survey target positions relative to machine references and check rotation order and units after maintenance; compare displayed cutterhead coordinates with external measurements and jointly approve geometry versions through equipment and survey leads.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b145-v14-14-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。假設目標距刀盤中心10 m、偏航0.1°，橫向桿臂修正10sin0.1°=17.45 mm；非可忽略常數。","textEn":"The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings. Assume target-to-cutterhead lever arm 10 m and yaw 0.1°; lateral correction is 10sin0.1°=17.45 mm, not a negligible constant.","sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]},{"id":"b145-v14-14-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「目標桿臂與機身姿態」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Target lever arms and machine attitude\", which statement holds?","options":["刀盤在設計線上就代表盾尾與已安裝環片必定同心。","兩個共用錯誤基準的感測器融合後可以消除共同偏差。","以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。"],"optionsEn":["A cutterhead on the design alignment guarantees concentric shield tail and installed rings.","Fusing two sensors sharing an incorrect datum eliminates their common bias.","The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings."],"answer":2,"explanation":"以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":14},{"id":"b145-v14-15","title":"目標桿臂與機身姿態：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Target lever arms and machine attitude: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"prerequisiteIds":["b145-v14-14"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「目標桿臂與機身姿態」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Target lever arms and machine attitude” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"以獨立機身基準量測目標位置，核對三維旋轉順序與單位，維修後重新查驗；將顯示刀盤坐標與外部測量比較，設備和測量主管共同確認幾何模型版本。驗證亦須釐清下列替代解釋：只做平移而漏掉旋轉會使長桿臂偏差放大，目標支架鬆動又可能被控制系統當成機器偏離；追逐錯誤導航訊號會造成真實線形修正過度。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Independently survey target positions relative to machine references and check rotation order and units after maintenance; compare displayed cutterhead coordinates with external measurements and jointly approve geometry versions through equipment and survey leads. Verification must also resolve this competing explanation: Applying translation without rotation amplifies long-lever errors, while a loose target bracket can mimic machine deviation. Steering in response to that false signal creates real overcorrection of the alignment. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：交接時逐項記錄目標桿臂與機身姿態的資料來源與適用條件。以獨立機身基準量測目標位置，核對三維旋轉順序與單位，維修後重新查驗；將顯示刀盤坐標與外部測量比較，設備和測量主管共同確認幾何模型版本。","observationEn":"Site practice: At handover, document the evidence and applicable conditions for target lever arms and machine attitude. Independently survey target positions relative to machine references and check rotation order and units after maintenance; compare displayed cutterhead coordinates with external measurements and jointly approve geometry versions through equipment and survey leads.","failure":"注意干擾：只做平移而漏掉旋轉會使長桿臂偏差放大，目標支架鬆動又可能被控制系統當成機器偏離；追逐錯誤導航訊號會造成真實線形修正過度。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Applying translation without rotation amplifies long-lever errors, while a loose target bracket can mimic machine deviation. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b145-v14-15-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以獨立機身基準量測目標位置，核對三維旋轉順序與單位，維修後重新查驗；將顯示刀盤坐標與外部測量比較，設備和測量主管共同確認幾何模型版本。驗證亦須釐清下列替代解釋：只做平移而漏掉旋轉會使長桿臂偏差放大，目標支架鬆動又可能被控制系統當成機器偏離；追逐錯誤導航訊號會造成真實線形修正過度。","textEn":"Independently survey target positions relative to machine references and check rotation order and units after maintenance; compare displayed cutterhead coordinates with external measurements and jointly approve geometry versions through equipment and survey leads. Verification must also resolve this competing explanation: Applying translation without rotation amplifies long-lever errors, while a loose target bracket can mimic machine deviation. Steering in response to that false signal creates real overcorrection of the alignment.","sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]},{"id":"b145-v14-15-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"交接時逐項記錄目標桿臂與機身姿態的資料來源與適用條件。以獨立機身基準量測目標位置，核對三維旋轉順序與單位，維修後重新查驗；將顯示刀盤坐標與外部測量比較，設備和測量主管共同確認幾何模型版本。","textEn":"At handover, document the evidence and applicable conditions for target lever arms and machine attitude. Independently survey target positions relative to machine references and check rotation order and units after maintenance; compare displayed cutterhead coordinates with external measurements and jointly approve geometry versions through equipment and survey leads.","sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「目標桿臂與機身姿態」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Target lever arms and machine attitude\"?","options":["以獨立機身基準量測目標位置，核對三維旋轉順序與單位，維修後重新查驗；將顯示刀盤坐標與外部測量比較，設備和測量主管共同確認幾何模型版本。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","坐標原點重合就保證整條長隧道的尺度與旋轉都正確。"],"optionsEn":["Independently survey target positions relative to machine references and check rotation order and units after maintenance.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","Coincident coordinate origins guarantee correct scale and rotation along the entire long tunnel."],"answer":0,"explanation":"以獨立機身基準量測目標位置，核對三維旋轉順序與單位，維修後重新查驗；將顯示刀盤坐標與外部測量比較，設備和測量主管共同確認幾何模型版本。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Independently survey target positions relative to machine references and check rotation order and units after maintenance; compare displayed cutterhead coordinates with external measurements and jointly approve geometry versions through equipment and survey leads. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":15},{"id":"b145-v14-16","title":"目標桿臂與機身姿態：失效診斷","titleEn":"Target lever arms and machine attitude: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"prerequisiteIds":["b145-v14-15"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「目標桿臂與機身姿態」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Target lever arms and machine attitude” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"只做平移而漏掉旋轉會使長桿臂偏差放大，目標支架鬆動又可能被控制系統當成機器偏離；追逐錯誤導航訊號會造成真實線形修正過度。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Applying translation without rotation amplifies long-lever errors, while a loose target bracket can mimic machine deviation. Steering in response to that false signal creates real overcorrection of the alignment. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：只做平移而漏掉旋轉會使長桿臂偏差放大，目標支架鬆動又可能被控制系統當成機器偏離；追逐錯誤導航訊號會造成真實線形修正過度。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Steering in response to that false signal creates real overcorrection of the alignment.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「從目標點算刀盤中心只需平移，不必考慮機身旋轉。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Transforming a target to cutterhead center requires translation only, without machine rotation.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b145-v14-16-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"只做平移而漏掉旋轉會使長桿臂偏差放大，目標支架鬆動又可能被控制系統當成機器偏離；追逐錯誤導航訊號會造成真實線形修正過度。","textEn":"Applying translation without rotation amplifies long-lever errors, while a loose target bracket can mimic machine deviation. Steering in response to that false signal creates real overcorrection of the alignment.","sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]},{"id":"b145-v14-16-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「目標桿臂與機身姿態」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Target lever arms and machine attitude\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的構件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","只做平移而漏掉旋轉會使長桿臂偏差放大，目標支架鬆動又可能被控制系統當成機器偏離；追逐錯誤導航訊號會造成真實線形修正過度。","平面里程和斜距可以不加說明直接用在同一環號表。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive component first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","Applying translation without rotation amplifies long-lever errors, while a loose target bracket can mimic machine deviation.","Horizontal chainage and slope distance can be interchanged within one ring table without explanation."],"answer":1,"explanation":"只做平移而漏掉旋轉會使長桿臂偏差放大，目標支架鬆動又可能被控制系統當成機器偏離；追逐錯誤導航訊號會造成真實線形修正過度。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Applying translation without rotation amplifies long-lever errors, while a loose target bracket can mimic machine deviation. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":16}],"order":2},{"id":"b145-v14-s3","title":"施工方法與施工階段控制","titleEn":"Construction methods and stage control","description":"本階段聚焦「設計線形與里程投影」與「曲線組環與楔形量」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Design alignment and chainage projection\" and \"Curved ring building and taper\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b145-v14-17","title":"設計線形與里程投影：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Design alignment and chainage projection: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"prerequisiteIds":["b145-v14-16"],"objective":"說明「設計線形與里程投影」如何影響潛盾掘進導向控制的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Design alignment and chainage projection” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “TBM alignment guidance and control”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"機器位置要投影到三維設計線形才能得到里程及橫縱偏差，曲線與縱坡使最近點不等同平面直線投影。線形版本和里程起算點需鎖定，否則各系統可能用不同名義位置討論同一環。 假設水平前進100 m、縱坡2%，高程變化2 m，斜長√(100²+2²)=100.020 m；里程定義須明示。 平面里程與斜距混用會逐步累積環號錯配，曲線左右符號用反又會顛倒修正方向；坐標數字合理仍不能保證工程定義一致。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「設計線形與里程投影」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Machine coordinates must project onto the three-dimensional design alignment to give chainage and offsets. Curvature and grade invalidate a simple planar projection, requiring a locked alignment version and station origin across systems. Assume 100 m horizontal advance on a 2% grade; elevation changes 2 m and slope length is 100.020 m, requiring an explicit chainage convention. Mixing horizontal chainage with slope distance progressively misassigns rings, while reversed left-right signs invert correction direction. Numerically plausible coordinates do not establish consistent engineering definitions across the workflow. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Design alignment and chainage projection” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings.","failure":"常見誤解：「平面里程和斜距可以不加說明直接用在同一環號表。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Horizontal chainage and slope distance can be interchanged within one ring table without explanation.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「設計線形與里程投影」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Design alignment and chainage projection”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b145-v14-17-k1","title":"設計線形與里程投影","titleEn":"Design alignment and chainage projection","text":"機器位置要投影到三維設計線形才能得到里程及橫縱偏差，曲線與縱坡使最近點不等同平面直線投影。線形版本和里程起算點需鎖定，否則各系統可能用不同名義位置討論同一環。","textEn":"Machine coordinates must project onto the three-dimensional design alignment to give chainage and offsets. Curvature and grade invalidate a simple planar projection, requiring a locked alignment version and station origin across systems.","sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]},{"id":"b145-v14-17-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：平面里程和斜距可以不加說明直接用在同一環號表。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Horizontal chainage and slope distance can be interchanged within one ring table without explanation. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「設計線形與里程投影」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Design alignment and chainage projection\" is correct?","options":["平面里程和斜距可以不加說明直接用在同一環號表。","只要能回到設計中心線，就不必檢查組環曲率與止水限制。","機器位置要投影到三維設計線形才能得到里程及橫縱偏差，曲線與縱坡使最近點不等同平面直線投影。"],"optionsEn":["Horizontal chainage and slope distance can be interchanged within one ring table without explanation.","Returning to the design centerline removes the need to check ring curvature and seal limits.","Machine coordinates must project onto the three-dimensional design alignment to give chainage and offsets."],"answer":2,"explanation":"機器位置要投影到三維設計線形才能得到里程及橫縱偏差，曲線與縱坡使最近點不等同平面直線投影。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Machine coordinates must project onto the three-dimensional design alignment to give chainage and offsets. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":17},{"id":"b145-v14-18","title":"設計線形與里程投影：定量估算","titleEn":"Design alignment and chainage projection: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"prerequisiteIds":["b145-v14-17"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「設計線形與里程投影」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Design alignment and chainage projection” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。假設水平前進100 m、縱坡2%，高程變化2 m，斜長√(100²+2²)=100.020 m；里程定義須明示。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings. Assume 100 m horizontal advance on a 2% grade; elevation changes 2 m and slope length is 100.020 m, requiring an explicit chainage convention. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：以已知曲線點和坡度點測試軟體投影，核對里程斷鏈與單位，將偏差向量畫在局部切線坐標；設計及測量團隊需共同核准線形更新，不能只交換沒有版本的坐標表。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Test software projection on known curve and grade points, checking station equations and units and plotting offsets in a local tangent frame; design and survey teams approve alignment revisions rather than exchanging unversioned coordinate tables.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b145-v14-18-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。假設水平前進100 m、縱坡2%，高程變化2 m，斜長√(100²+2²)=100.020 m；里程定義須明示。","textEn":"The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings. Assume 100 m horizontal advance on a 2% grade; elevation changes 2 m and slope length is 100.020 m, requiring an explicit chainage convention.","sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]},{"id":"b145-v14-18-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「設計線形與里程投影」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Design alignment and chainage projection\", which statement holds?","options":["以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。","把受折射影響的讀值平滑後就能恢復真實機器姿態。","事後強制閉合差歸零，就不需要再保存原始貫通誤差。"],"optionsEn":["The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings.","Smoothing refracted observations restores the true machine attitude automatically.","Forcing closure to zero afterward removes any need to retain the original breakthrough discrepancy."],"answer":0,"explanation":"以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":18},{"id":"b145-v14-19","title":"設計線形與里程投影：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Design alignment and chainage projection: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"prerequisiteIds":["b145-v14-18"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「設計線形與里程投影」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Design alignment and chainage projection” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"以已知曲線點和坡度點測試軟體投影，核對里程斷鏈與單位，將偏差向量畫在局部切線坐標；設計及測量團隊需共同核准線形更新，不能只交換沒有版本的坐標表。驗證亦須釐清下列替代解釋：平面里程與斜距混用會逐步累積環號錯配，曲線左右符號用反又會顛倒修正方向；坐標數字合理仍不能保證工程定義一致。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Test software projection on known curve and grade points, checking station equations and units and plotting offsets in a local tangent frame; design and survey teams approve alignment revisions rather than exchanging unversioned coordinate tables. Verification must also resolve this competing explanation: Mixing horizontal chainage with slope distance progressively misassigns rings, while reversed left-right signs invert correction direction. Numerically plausible coordinates do not establish consistent engineering definitions across the workflow. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：交接時逐項記錄設計線形與里程投影的資料來源與適用條件。以已知曲線點和坡度點測試軟體投影，核對里程斷鏈與單位，將偏差向量畫在局部切線坐標；設計及測量團隊需共同核准線形更新，不能只交換沒有版本的坐標表。","observationEn":"Site practice: At handover, document the evidence and applicable conditions for design alignment and chainage projection. Test software projection on known curve and grade points, checking station equations and units and plotting offsets in a local tangent frame; design and survey teams approve alignment revisions rather than exchanging unversioned coordinate tables.","failure":"注意干擾：平面里程與斜距混用會逐步累積環號錯配，曲線左右符號用反又會顛倒修正方向；坐標數字合理仍不能保證工程定義一致。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Mixing horizontal chainage with slope distance progressively misassigns rings, while reversed left-right signs invert correction direction. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b145-v14-19-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以已知曲線點和坡度點測試軟體投影，核對里程斷鏈與單位，將偏差向量畫在局部切線坐標；設計及測量團隊需共同核准線形更新，不能只交換沒有版本的坐標表。驗證亦須釐清下列替代解釋：平面里程與斜距混用會逐步累積環號錯配，曲線左右符號用反又會顛倒修正方向；坐標數字合理仍不能保證工程定義一致。","textEn":"Test software projection on known curve and grade points, checking station equations and units and plotting offsets in a local tangent frame; design and survey teams approve alignment revisions rather than exchanging unversioned coordinate tables. Verification must also resolve this competing explanation: Mixing horizontal chainage with slope distance progressively misassigns rings, while reversed left-right signs invert correction direction. Numerically plausible coordinates do not establish consistent engineering definitions across the workflow.","sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]},{"id":"b145-v14-19-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"交接時逐項記錄設計線形與里程投影的資料來源與適用條件。以已知曲線點和坡度點測試軟體投影，核對里程斷鏈與單位，將偏差向量畫在局部切線坐標；設計及測量團隊需共同核准線形更新，不能只交換沒有版本的坐標表。","textEn":"At handover, document the evidence and applicable conditions for design alignment and chainage projection. Test software projection on known curve and grade points, checking station equations and units and plotting offsets in a local tangent frame; design and survey teams approve alignment revisions rather than exchanging unversioned coordinate tables.","sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「設計線形與里程投影」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Design alignment and chainage projection\"?","options":["允收準則可以等看到量測數據後再決定。","以已知曲線點和坡度點測試軟體投影，核對里程斷鏈與單位，將偏差向量畫在局部切線坐標；設計及測量團隊需共同核准線形更新，不能只交換沒有版本的坐標表。","每一測段的角度誤差必定獨立而且可以互相抵消。"],"optionsEn":["Acceptance criteria can be decided after the measured data have been seen.","Test software projection on known curve and grade points, checking station equations and units and plotting offsets in a local tangent frame.","Angular errors in every survey segment are necessarily independent and cancel each other."],"answer":1,"explanation":"以已知曲線點和坡度點測試軟體投影，核對里程斷鏈與單位，將偏差向量畫在局部切線坐標；設計及測量團隊需共同核准線形更新，不能只交換沒有版本的坐標表。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Test software projection on known curve and grade points, checking station equations and units and plotting offsets in a local tangent frame; design and survey teams approve alignment revisions rather than exchanging unversioned coordinate tables. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":19},{"id":"b145-v14-20","title":"設計線形與里程投影：失效診斷","titleEn":"Design alignment and chainage projection: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"prerequisiteIds":["b145-v14-19"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「設計線形與里程投影」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Design alignment and chainage projection” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"平面里程與斜距混用會逐步累積環號錯配，曲線左右符號用反又會顛倒修正方向；坐標數字合理仍不能保證工程定義一致。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Mixing horizontal chainage with slope distance progressively misassigns rings, while reversed left-right signs invert correction direction. Numerically plausible coordinates do not establish consistent engineering definitions across the workflow. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：平面里程與斜距混用會逐步累積環號錯配，曲線左右符號用反又會顛倒修正方向；坐標數字合理仍不能保證工程定義一致。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Numerically plausible coordinates do not establish consistent engineering definitions across the workflow.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「平面里程和斜距可以不加說明直接用在同一環號表。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Horizontal chainage and slope distance can be interchanged within one ring table without explanation.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b145-v14-20-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"平面里程與斜距混用會逐步累積環號錯配，曲線左右符號用反又會顛倒修正方向；坐標數字合理仍不能保證工程定義一致。","textEn":"Mixing horizontal chainage with slope distance progressively misassigns rings, while reversed left-right signs invert correction direction. Numerically plausible coordinates do not establish consistent engineering definitions across the workflow.","sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]},{"id":"b145-v14-20-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「設計線形與里程投影」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Design alignment and chainage projection\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["症狀相同就代表原因相同，不必用量測區分。","只要能回到設計中心線，就不必檢查組環曲率與止水限制。","平面里程與斜距混用會逐步累積環號錯配，曲線左右符號用反又會顛倒修正方向；坐標數字合理仍不能保證工程定義一致。"],"optionsEn":["Identical symptoms always mean identical causes, so no discriminating measurement is needed.","Returning to the design centerline removes the need to check ring curvature and seal limits.","Mixing horizontal chainage with slope distance progressively misassigns rings, while reversed left-right signs invert correction direction."],"answer":2,"explanation":"平面里程與斜距混用會逐步累積環號錯配，曲線左右符號用反又會顛倒修正方向；坐標數字合理仍不能保證工程定義一致。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Mixing horizontal chainage with slope distance progressively misassigns rings, while reversed left-right signs invert correction direction. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":20},{"id":"b145-v14-21","title":"曲線組環與楔形量：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Curved ring building and taper: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"prerequisiteIds":["b145-v14-20"],"objective":"說明「曲線組環與楔形量」如何影響潛盾掘進導向控制的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Curved ring building and taper” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “TBM alignment guidance and control”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"楔形環片透過端面厚度差逐環改變軸線，旋轉組環可調整轉彎方向，但可達曲率受幾何與接縫限制。導航建議需和環片配置、尾隙及止水變形共同審查，不只是追逐中心線。 假設環寬1.5 m、曲率半徑300 m，每環轉角約L/R=0.005 rad=0.286°；為小角近似。 只求快速回到中心線可能使用過大曲率，造成接縫張開或尾刷偏壓；未記組環方向又使後續竣工線形無法對應到設計的幾何假設。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「曲線組環與楔形量」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Tapered rings change axis direction through face-width differences, with ring rotation selecting direction. Achievable curvature depends on geometry and joints, requiring navigation choices to respect ring layout, tail clearance and gasket deformation rather than centerline alone. Assume ring width 1.5 m and curvature radius 300 m; turn per ring is approximately L/R=0.005 rad=0.286°, a small-angle approximation. Rapid centerline recovery can demand excessive curvature and produce joint opening or seal loading. Missing ring orientation records also prevent the as-built alignment from being reconciled with the assumed geometry. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Curved ring building and taper” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings.","failure":"常見誤解：「只要能回到設計中心線，就不必檢查組環曲率與止水限制。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Returning to the design centerline removes the need to check ring curvature and seal limits.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「曲線組環與楔形量」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Curved ring building and taper”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b145-v14-21-k1","title":"曲線組環與楔形量","titleEn":"Curved ring building and taper","text":"楔形環片透過端面厚度差逐環改變軸線，旋轉組環可調整轉彎方向，但可達曲率受幾何與接縫限制。導航建議需和環片配置、尾隙及止水變形共同審查，不只是追逐中心線。","textEn":"Tapered rings change axis direction through face-width differences, with ring rotation selecting direction. Achievable curvature depends on geometry and joints, requiring navigation choices to respect ring layout, tail clearance and gasket deformation rather than centerline alone.","sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]},{"id":"b145-v14-21-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：只要能回到設計中心線，就不必檢查組環曲率與止水限制。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Returning to the design centerline removes the need to check ring curvature and seal limits. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「曲線組環與楔形量」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Curved ring building and taper\" is correct?","options":["楔形環片透過端面厚度差逐環改變軸線，旋轉組環可調整轉彎方向，但可達曲率受幾何與接縫限制。","只要能回到設計中心線，就不必檢查組環曲率與止水限制。","刀盤在設計線上就代表盾尾與已安裝環片必定同心。"],"optionsEn":["Tapered rings change axis direction through face-width differences, with ring rotation selecting direction.","Returning to the design centerline removes the need to check ring curvature and seal limits.","A cutterhead on the design alignment guarantees concentric shield tail and installed rings."],"answer":0,"explanation":"楔形環片透過端面厚度差逐環改變軸線，旋轉組環可調整轉彎方向，但可達曲率受幾何與接縫限制。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Tapered rings change axis direction through face-width differences, with ring rotation selecting direction. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":21},{"id":"b145-v14-22","title":"曲線組環與楔形量：定量估算","titleEn":"Curved ring building and taper: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"prerequisiteIds":["b145-v14-21"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「曲線組環與楔形量」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Curved ring building and taper” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。假設環寬1.5 m、曲率半徑300 m，每環轉角約L/R=0.005 rad=0.286°；為小角近似。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings. Assume ring width 1.5 m and curvature radius 300 m; turn per ring is approximately L/R=0.005 rad=0.286°, a small-angle approximation. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：用核准環片幾何模型重算可達轉角，對照實際組環方向、接縫錯台與尾隙；測量和結構工程師檢查累積幾何，任何組環選擇仍由現場核准程序決定，算例不發出拼裝指令。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Recalculate achievable rotation from approved ring geometry and compare orientation, joint offset and tail clearance; survey and structural leads check accumulation, while actual ring selection follows approved site procedures rather than this calculation.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b145-v14-22-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。假設環寬1.5 m、曲率半徑300 m，每環轉角約L/R=0.005 rad=0.286°；為小角近似。","textEn":"The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings. Assume ring width 1.5 m and curvature radius 300 m; turn per ring is approximately L/R=0.005 rad=0.286°, a small-angle approximation.","sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]},{"id":"b145-v14-22-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「曲線組環與楔形量」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Curved ring building and taper\", which statement holds?","options":["兩個共用錯誤基準的感測器融合後可以消除共同偏差。","以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。","坐標原點重合就保證整條長隧道的尺度與旋轉都正確。"],"optionsEn":["Fusing two sensors sharing an incorrect datum eliminates their common bias.","The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings.","Coincident coordinate origins guarantee correct scale and rotation along the entire long tunnel."],"answer":1,"explanation":"以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":22},{"id":"b145-v14-23","title":"曲線組環與楔形量：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Curved ring building and taper: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"prerequisiteIds":["b145-v14-22"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「曲線組環與楔形量」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Curved ring building and taper” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"用核准環片幾何模型重算可達轉角，對照實際組環方向、接縫錯台與尾隙；測量和結構工程師檢查累積幾何，任何組環選擇仍由現場核准程序決定，算例不發出拼裝指令。驗證亦須釐清下列替代解釋：只求快速回到中心線可能使用過大曲率，造成接縫張開或尾刷偏壓；未記組環方向又使後續竣工線形無法對應到設計的幾何假設。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Recalculate achievable rotation from approved ring geometry and compare orientation, joint offset and tail clearance; survey and structural leads check accumulation, while actual ring selection follows approved site procedures rather than this calculation. Verification must also resolve this competing explanation: Rapid centerline recovery can demand excessive curvature and produce joint opening or seal loading. Missing ring orientation records also prevent the as-built alignment from being reconciled with the assumed geometry. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：交接時逐項記錄曲線組環與楔形量的資料來源與適用條件。用核准環片幾何模型重算可達轉角，對照實際組環方向、接縫錯台與尾隙；測量和結構工程師檢查累積幾何，任何組環選擇仍由現場核准程序決定，算例不發出拼裝指令。","observationEn":"Site practice: At handover, document the evidence and applicable conditions for curved ring building and taper. Recalculate achievable rotation from approved ring geometry and compare orientation, joint offset and tail clearance; survey and structural leads check accumulation, while actual ring selection follows approved site procedures rather than this calculation.","failure":"注意干擾：只求快速回到中心線可能使用過大曲率，造成接縫張開或尾刷偏壓；未記組環方向又使後續竣工線形無法對應到設計的幾何假設。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Rapid centerline recovery can demand excessive curvature and produce joint opening or seal loading. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b145-v14-23-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"用核准環片幾何模型重算可達轉角，對照實際組環方向、接縫錯台與尾隙；測量和結構工程師檢查累積幾何，任何組環選擇仍由現場核准程序決定，算例不發出拼裝指令。驗證亦須釐清下列替代解釋：只求快速回到中心線可能使用過大曲率，造成接縫張開或尾刷偏壓；未記組環方向又使後續竣工線形無法對應到設計的幾何假設。","textEn":"Recalculate achievable rotation from approved ring geometry and compare orientation, joint offset and tail clearance; survey and structural leads check accumulation, while actual ring selection follows approved site procedures rather than this calculation. Verification must also resolve this competing explanation: Rapid centerline recovery can demand excessive curvature and produce joint opening or seal loading. Missing ring orientation records also prevent the as-built alignment from being reconciled with the assumed geometry.","sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]},{"id":"b145-v14-23-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"交接時逐項記錄曲線組環與楔形量的資料來源與適用條件。用核准環片幾何模型重算可達轉角，對照實際組環方向、接縫錯台與尾隙；測量和結構工程師檢查累積幾何，任何組環選擇仍由現場核准程序決定，算例不發出拼裝指令。","textEn":"At handover, document the evidence and applicable conditions for curved ring building and taper. Recalculate achievable rotation from approved ring geometry and compare orientation, joint offset and tail clearance; survey and structural leads check accumulation, while actual ring selection follows approved site procedures rather than this calculation.","sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「曲線組環與楔形量」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Curved ring building and taper\"?","options":["只要結構分析模型看起來合理，就可以省略現場量測與試驗。","陀螺方向是自動真值，不需再校準或考慮溫度漂移。","用核准環片幾何模型重算可達轉角，對照實際組環方向、接縫錯台與尾隙；測量和結構工程師檢查累積幾何，任何組環選擇仍由現場核准程序決定，算例不發出拼裝指令。"],"optionsEn":["If the structural model looks reasonable, site measurement and testing can be skipped.","Gyro orientation is automatic truth needing no calibration or thermal-drift consideration.","Recalculate achievable rotation from approved ring geometry and compare orientation, joint offset and tail clearance."],"answer":2,"explanation":"用核准環片幾何模型重算可達轉角，對照實際組環方向、接縫錯台與尾隙；測量和結構工程師檢查累積幾何，任何組環選擇仍由現場核准程序決定，算例不發出拼裝指令。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Recalculate achievable rotation from approved ring geometry and compare orientation, joint offset and tail clearance; survey and structural leads check accumulation, while actual ring selection follows approved site procedures rather than this calculation. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":23},{"id":"b145-v14-24","title":"曲線組環與楔形量：失效診斷","titleEn":"Curved ring building and taper: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"prerequisiteIds":["b145-v14-23"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「曲線組環與楔形量」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Curved ring building and taper” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"只求快速回到中心線可能使用過大曲率，造成接縫張開或尾刷偏壓；未記組環方向又使後續竣工線形無法對應到設計的幾何假設。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Rapid centerline recovery can demand excessive curvature and produce joint opening or seal loading. Missing ring orientation records also prevent the as-built alignment from being reconciled with the assumed geometry. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：只求快速回到中心線可能使用過大曲率，造成接縫張開或尾刷偏壓；未記組環方向又使後續竣工線形無法對應到設計的幾何假設。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Missing ring orientation records also prevent the as-built alignment from being reconciled with the assumed geometry.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「只要能回到設計中心線，就不必檢查組環曲率與止水限制。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Returning to the design centerline removes the need to check ring curvature and seal limits.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b145-v14-24-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"只求快速回到中心線可能使用過大曲率，造成接縫張開或尾刷偏壓；未記組環方向又使後續竣工線形無法對應到設計的幾何假設。","textEn":"Rapid centerline recovery can demand excessive curvature and produce joint opening or seal loading. Missing ring orientation records also prevent the as-built alignment from being reconciled with the assumed geometry.","sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]},{"id":"b145-v14-24-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「曲線組環與楔形量」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Curved ring building and taper\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["只求快速回到中心線可能使用過大曲率，造成接縫張開或尾刷偏壓；未記組環方向又使後續竣工線形無法對應到設計的幾何假設。","只要結構還沒倒，就代表安全餘裕仍然足夠。","刀盤在設計線上就代表盾尾與已安裝環片必定同心。"],"optionsEn":["Rapid centerline recovery can demand excessive curvature and produce joint opening or seal loading.","As long as the structure is still standing, its safety margin must still be adequate.","A cutterhead on the design alignment guarantees concentric shield tail and installed rings."],"answer":0,"explanation":"只求快速回到中心線可能使用過大曲率，造成接縫張開或尾刷偏壓；未記組環方向又使後續竣工線形無法對應到設計的幾何假設。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Rapid centerline recovery can demand excessive curvature and produce joint opening or seal loading. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":24}],"order":3},{"id":"b145-v14-s4","title":"試驗、量測與監測驗證","titleEn":"Testing, measurement and monitoring","description":"本階段聚焦「尾隙與機器環片相對位移」與「折射環境與品質旗標」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Relative machine-ring clearance\" and \"Refraction environment and quality flags\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b145-v14-25","title":"尾隙與機器環片相對位移：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Relative machine-ring clearance: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"prerequisiteIds":["b145-v14-24"],"objective":"說明「尾隙與機器環片相對位移」如何影響潛盾掘進導向控制的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Relative machine-ring clearance” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “TBM alignment guidance and control”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"刀盤中心在設計線上不代表盾尾與環片同心，機身轉動、環片抬升及變形會改變相對間隙。導航應同時看機器和已裝環的位置，把線形控制與防水、結構介面連起來。 假設機器中心右偏12 mm、環中心右偏5 mm，相對偏心7 mm；不能用12 mm直接當尾隙偏差。 忽略環片浮起會把尾隙變化全歸機器偏航，錯誤修正可能進一步壓傷密封；只看平均中心差又會漏掉橢圓化造成的局部接觸不足。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「尾隙與機器環片相對位移」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"A cutterhead on alignment does not ensure concentric shield tail and lining. Machine rotation, ring uplift and deformation alter relative clearance, requiring both machine and installed-ring positions to connect guidance with sealing and structural interfaces. Assume machine center 12 mm right and ring center 5 mm right; relative eccentricity is 7 mm, not the full 12 mm machine offset. Ignoring ring uplift attributes every gap change to machine yaw and can worsen seal loading through incorrect correction. Mean center difference also misses local contact loss caused by ring ovalization. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Relative machine-ring clearance” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings.","failure":"常見誤解：「刀盤在設計線上就代表盾尾與已安裝環片必定同心。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A cutterhead on the design alignment guarantees concentric shield tail and installed rings.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「尾隙與機器環片相對位移」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Relative machine-ring clearance”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b145-v14-25-k1","title":"尾隙與機器環片相對位移","titleEn":"Relative machine-ring clearance","text":"刀盤中心在設計線上不代表盾尾與環片同心，機身轉動、環片抬升及變形會改變相對間隙。導航應同時看機器和已裝環的位置，把線形控制與防水、結構介面連起來。","textEn":"A cutterhead on alignment does not ensure concentric shield tail and lining. Machine rotation, ring uplift and deformation alter relative clearance, requiring both machine and installed-ring positions to connect guidance with sealing and structural interfaces.","sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]},{"id":"b145-v14-25-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：刀盤在設計線上就代表盾尾與已安裝環片必定同心。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A cutterhead on the design alignment guarantees concentric shield tail and installed rings. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「尾隙與機器環片相對位移」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Relative machine-ring clearance\" is correct?","options":["刀盤在設計線上就代表盾尾與已安裝環片必定同心。","刀盤中心在設計線上不代表盾尾與環片同心，機身轉動、環片抬升及變形會改變相對間隙。","把受折射影響的讀值平滑後就能恢復真實機器姿態。"],"optionsEn":["A cutterhead on the design alignment guarantees concentric shield tail and installed rings.","A cutterhead on alignment does not ensure concentric shield tail and lining.","Smoothing refracted observations restores the true machine attitude automatically."],"answer":1,"explanation":"刀盤中心在設計線上不代表盾尾與環片同心，機身轉動、環片抬升及變形會改變相對間隙。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"A cutterhead on alignment does not ensure concentric shield tail and lining. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":25},{"id":"b145-v14-26","title":"尾隙與機器環片相對位移：定量估算","titleEn":"Relative machine-ring clearance: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"prerequisiteIds":["b145-v14-25"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「尾隙與機器環片相對位移」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Relative machine-ring clearance” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。假設機器中心右偏12 mm、環中心右偏5 mm，相對偏心7 mm；不能用12 mm直接當尾隙偏差。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings. Assume machine center 12 mm right and ring center 5 mm right; relative eccentricity is 7 mm, not the full 12 mm machine offset. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：同時量測尾隙、機身姿態與最新環片中心，使用同一坐標和時刻比較；將局部最大間隙與核准設備包絡核對，偏差原因由測量、設備和組環負責人共同辨識。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Measure clearance, pose and latest ring center at a common time and datum; compare local extreme gaps with the approved equipment envelope and jointly identify causes through survey, equipment and ring-building leads.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b145-v14-26-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。假設機器中心右偏12 mm、環中心右偏5 mm，相對偏心7 mm；不能用12 mm直接當尾隙偏差。","textEn":"The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings. Assume machine center 12 mm right and ring center 5 mm right; relative eccentricity is 7 mm, not the full 12 mm machine offset.","sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]},{"id":"b145-v14-26-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「尾隙與機器環片相對位移」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Relative machine-ring clearance\", which statement holds?","options":["事後強制閉合差歸零，就不需要再保存原始貫通誤差。","每一測段的角度誤差必定獨立而且可以互相抵消。","以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。"],"optionsEn":["Forcing closure to zero afterward removes any need to retain the original breakthrough discrepancy.","Angular errors in every survey segment are necessarily independent and cancel each other.","The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings."],"answer":2,"explanation":"以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":26},{"id":"b145-v14-27","title":"尾隙與機器環片相對位移：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Relative machine-ring clearance: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"prerequisiteIds":["b145-v14-26"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「尾隙與機器環片相對位移」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Relative machine-ring clearance” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"同時量測尾隙、機身姿態與最新環片中心，使用同一坐標和時刻比較；將局部最大間隙與核准設備包絡核對，偏差原因由測量、設備和組環負責人共同辨識。驗證亦須釐清下列替代解釋：忽略環片浮起會把尾隙變化全歸機器偏航，錯誤修正可能進一步壓傷密封；只看平均中心差又會漏掉橢圓化造成的局部接觸不足。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Measure clearance, pose and latest ring center at a common time and datum; compare local extreme gaps with the approved equipment envelope and jointly identify causes through survey, equipment and ring-building leads. Verification must also resolve this competing explanation: Ignoring ring uplift attributes every gap change to machine yaw and can worsen seal loading through incorrect correction. Mean center difference also misses local contact loss caused by ring ovalization. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：交接時逐項記錄尾隙與機器環片相對位移的資料來源與適用條件。同時量測尾隙、機身姿態與最新環片中心，使用同一坐標和時刻比較；將局部最大間隙與核准設備包絡核對，偏差原因由測量、設備和組環負責人共同辨識。","observationEn":"Site practice: At handover, document the evidence and applicable conditions for relative machine-ring clearance. Measure clearance, pose and latest ring center at a common time and datum; compare local extreme gaps with the approved equipment envelope and jointly identify causes through survey, equipment and ring-building leads.","failure":"注意干擾：忽略環片浮起會把尾隙變化全歸機器偏航，錯誤修正可能進一步壓傷密封；只看平均中心差又會漏掉橢圓化造成的局部接觸不足。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Ignoring ring uplift attributes every gap change to machine yaw and can worsen seal loading through incorrect correction. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b145-v14-27-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"同時量測尾隙、機身姿態與最新環片中心，使用同一坐標和時刻比較；將局部最大間隙與核准設備包絡核對，偏差原因由測量、設備和組環負責人共同辨識。驗證亦須釐清下列替代解釋：忽略環片浮起會把尾隙變化全歸機器偏航，錯誤修正可能進一步壓傷密封；只看平均中心差又會漏掉橢圓化造成的局部接觸不足。","textEn":"Measure clearance, pose and latest ring center at a common time and datum; compare local extreme gaps with the approved equipment envelope and jointly identify causes through survey, equipment and ring-building leads. Verification must also resolve this competing explanation: Ignoring ring uplift attributes every gap change to machine yaw and can worsen seal loading through incorrect correction. Mean center difference also misses local contact loss caused by ring ovalization.","sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]},{"id":"b145-v14-27-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"交接時逐項記錄尾隙與機器環片相對位移的資料來源與適用條件。同時量測尾隙、機身姿態與最新環片中心，使用同一坐標和時刻比較；將局部最大間隙與核准設備包絡核對，偏差原因由測量、設備和組環負責人共同辨識。","textEn":"At handover, document the evidence and applicable conditions for relative machine-ring clearance. Measure clearance, pose and latest ring center at a common time and datum; compare local extreme gaps with the approved equipment envelope and jointly identify causes through survey, equipment and ring-building leads.","sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「尾隙與機器環片相對位移」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Relative machine-ring clearance\"?","options":["同時量測尾隙、機身姿態與最新環片中心，使用同一坐標和時刻比較；將局部最大間隙與核准設備包絡核對，偏差原因由測量、設備和組環負責人共同辨識。","量測時不必記錄溫度、水頭、開挖序列與施工荷重，因為它們不會影響結果。","從目標點算刀盤中心只需平移，不必考慮機身旋轉。"],"optionsEn":["Measure clearance, pose and latest ring center at a common time and datum.","Temperature, water head, excavation sequence and construction loads need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","Transforming a target to cutterhead center requires translation only, without machine rotation."],"answer":0,"explanation":"同時量測尾隙、機身姿態與最新環片中心，使用同一坐標和時刻比較；將局部最大間隙與核准設備包絡核對，偏差原因由測量、設備和組環負責人共同辨識。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Measure clearance, pose and latest ring center at a common time and datum; compare local extreme gaps with the approved equipment envelope and jointly identify causes through survey, equipment and ring-building leads. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":27},{"id":"b145-v14-28","title":"尾隙與機器環片相對位移：失效診斷","titleEn":"Relative machine-ring clearance: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"prerequisiteIds":["b145-v14-27"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「尾隙與機器環片相對位移」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Relative machine-ring clearance” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"忽略環片浮起會把尾隙變化全歸機器偏航，錯誤修正可能進一步壓傷密封；只看平均中心差又會漏掉橢圓化造成的局部接觸不足。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Ignoring ring uplift attributes every gap change to machine yaw and can worsen seal loading through incorrect correction. Mean center difference also misses local contact loss caused by ring ovalization. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：忽略環片浮起會把尾隙變化全歸機器偏航，錯誤修正可能進一步壓傷密封；只看平均中心差又會漏掉橢圓化造成的局部接觸不足。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Mean center difference also misses local contact loss caused by ring ovalization.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「刀盤在設計線上就代表盾尾與已安裝環片必定同心。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A cutterhead on the design alignment guarantees concentric shield tail and installed rings.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b145-v14-28-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"忽略環片浮起會把尾隙變化全歸機器偏航，錯誤修正可能進一步壓傷密封；只看平均中心差又會漏掉橢圓化造成的局部接觸不足。","textEn":"Ignoring ring uplift attributes every gap change to machine yaw and can worsen seal loading through incorrect correction. Mean center difference also misses local contact loss caused by ring ovalization.","sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]},{"id":"b145-v14-28-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「尾隙與機器環片相對位移」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Relative machine-ring clearance\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自施工人員失誤，設計與細部不需要檢討。","忽略環片浮起會把尾隙變化全歸機器偏航，錯誤修正可能進一步壓傷密封；只看平均中心差又會漏掉橢圓化造成的局部接觸不足。","把受折射影響的讀值平滑後就能恢復真實機器姿態。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is a workmanship error, so design and detailing never need review.","Ignoring ring uplift attributes every gap change to machine yaw and can worsen seal loading through incorrect correction.","Smoothing refracted observations restores the true machine attitude automatically."],"answer":1,"explanation":"忽略環片浮起會把尾隙變化全歸機器偏航，錯誤修正可能進一步壓傷密封；只看平均中心差又會漏掉橢圓化造成的局部接觸不足。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Ignoring ring uplift attributes every gap change to machine yaw and can worsen seal loading through incorrect correction. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":28},{"id":"b145-v14-29","title":"折射環境與品質旗標：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Refraction environment and quality flags: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"prerequisiteIds":["b145-v14-28"],"objective":"說明「折射環境與品質旗標」如何影響潛盾掘進導向控制的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Refraction environment and quality flags” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “TBM alignment guidance and control”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"隧道熱流和粉塵影響光學測量，量測仍有數字不代表品質正常。環境造成的偏差可能具有方向性，應利用多基準或不同時段交叉檢查，並讓品質旗標隨導航結果一同傳遞。 假設兩次同點讀值相差6 mm、各標準不確定2 mm且獨立，差值標準不確定2.83 mm，差約2.12倍。 熱折射可能使多點一致偏移，濾波後曲線更平順卻更像真實轉向；若品質旗標未傳到決策端，系統會對低可信度數值給出過度確定的判讀。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「折射環境與品質旗標」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Heat flow and dust affect optical observations, and a numeric output does not ensure good quality. Directional environmental bias requires multiple references or time-separated checks, with quality flags traveling alongside the navigation result. Two assumed observations differ by 6 mm with independent 2 mm standard uncertainties each; difference uncertainty is 2.83 mm and the discrepancy is about 2.12 times it. Thermal refraction can shift many points together, and filtering makes the false trend resemble genuine steering. Missing quality flags cause the decision layer to treat low-confidence observations as definite positions. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Refraction environment and quality flags” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings.","failure":"常見誤解：「把受折射影響的讀值平滑後就能恢復真實機器姿態。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Smoothing refracted observations restores the true machine attitude automatically.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「折射環境與品質旗標」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Refraction environment and quality flags”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b145-v14-29-k1","title":"折射環境與品質旗標","titleEn":"Refraction environment and quality flags","text":"隧道熱流和粉塵影響光學測量，量測仍有數字不代表品質正常。環境造成的偏差可能具有方向性，應利用多基準或不同時段交叉檢查，並讓品質旗標隨導航結果一同傳遞。","textEn":"Heat flow and dust affect optical observations, and a numeric output does not ensure good quality. Directional environmental bias requires multiple references or time-separated checks, with quality flags traveling alongside the navigation result.","sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]},{"id":"b145-v14-29-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：把受折射影響的讀值平滑後就能恢復真實機器姿態。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Smoothing refracted observations restores the true machine attitude automatically. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「折射環境與品質旗標」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Refraction environment and quality flags\" is correct?","options":["把受折射影響的讀值平滑後就能恢復真實機器姿態。","兩個共用錯誤基準的感測器融合後可以消除共同偏差。","隧道熱流和粉塵影響光學測量，量測仍有數字不代表品質正常。"],"optionsEn":["Smoothing refracted observations restores the true machine attitude automatically.","Fusing two sensors sharing an incorrect datum eliminates their common bias.","Heat flow and dust affect optical observations, and a numeric output does not ensure good quality."],"answer":2,"explanation":"隧道熱流和粉塵影響光學測量，量測仍有數字不代表品質正常。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Heat flow and dust affect optical observations, and a numeric output does not ensure good quality. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":29},{"id":"b145-v14-30","title":"折射環境與品質旗標：定量估算","titleEn":"Refraction environment and quality flags: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"prerequisiteIds":["b145-v14-29"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「折射環境與品質旗標」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Refraction environment and quality flags” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。假設兩次同點讀值相差6 mm、各標準不確定2 mm且獨立，差值標準不確定2.83 mm，差約2.12倍。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings. Two assumed observations differ by 6 mm with independent 2 mm standard uncertainties each; difference uncertainty is 2.83 mm and the discrepancy is about 2.12 times it. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：記錄可視、溫度與儀器追蹤狀態，對照穩定參考點及備援量測，判斷共模偏差；不佳品質時由測量主管依核准程序確認資料用途，不能平滑後隱藏環境事件。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Record visibility, temperature and tracking status and compare stable references and backup observations for common bias; survey leads determine acceptable use under approved procedures rather than smoothing environmental events out of the record.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b145-v14-30-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。假設兩次同點讀值相差6 mm、各標準不確定2 mm且獨立，差值標準不確定2.83 mm，差約2.12倍。","textEn":"The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings. Two assumed observations differ by 6 mm with independent 2 mm standard uncertainties each; difference uncertainty is 2.83 mm and the discrepancy is about 2.12 times it.","sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]},{"id":"b145-v14-30-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「折射環境與品質旗標」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Refraction environment and quality flags\", which statement holds?","options":["以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。","坐標原點重合就保證整條長隧道的尺度與旋轉都正確。","陀螺方向是自動真值，不需再校準或考慮溫度漂移。"],"optionsEn":["The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings.","Coincident coordinate origins guarantee correct scale and rotation along the entire long tunnel.","Gyro orientation is automatic truth needing no calibration or thermal-drift consideration."],"answer":0,"explanation":"以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":30},{"id":"b145-v14-31","title":"折射環境與品質旗標：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Refraction environment and quality flags: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"prerequisiteIds":["b145-v14-30"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「折射環境與品質旗標」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Refraction environment and quality flags” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"記錄可視、溫度與儀器追蹤狀態，對照穩定參考點及備援量測，判斷共模偏差；不佳品質時由測量主管依核准程序確認資料用途，不能平滑後隱藏環境事件。驗證亦須釐清下列替代解釋：熱折射可能使多點一致偏移，濾波後曲線更平順卻更像真實轉向；若品質旗標未傳到決策端，系統會對低可信度數值給出過度確定的判讀。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Record visibility, temperature and tracking status and compare stable references and backup observations for common bias; survey leads determine acceptable use under approved procedures rather than smoothing environmental events out of the record. Verification must also resolve this competing explanation: Thermal refraction can shift many points together, and filtering makes the false trend resemble genuine steering. Missing quality flags cause the decision layer to treat low-confidence observations as definite positions. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：交接時逐項記錄折射環境與品質旗標的資料來源與適用條件。記錄可視、溫度與儀器追蹤狀態，對照穩定參考點及備援量測，判斷共模偏差；不佳品質時由測量主管依核准程序確認資料用途，不能平滑後隱藏環境事件。","observationEn":"Site practice: At handover, document the evidence and applicable conditions for refraction environment and quality flags. Record visibility, temperature and tracking status and compare stable references and backup observations for common bias; survey leads determine acceptable use under approved procedures rather than smoothing environmental events out of the record.","failure":"注意干擾：熱折射可能使多點一致偏移，濾波後曲線更平順卻更像真實轉向；若品質旗標未傳到決策端，系統會對低可信度數值給出過度確定的判讀。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Thermal refraction can shift many points together, and filtering makes the false trend resemble genuine steering. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b145-v14-31-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"記錄可視、溫度與儀器追蹤狀態，對照穩定參考點及備援量測，判斷共模偏差；不佳品質時由測量主管依核准程序確認資料用途，不能平滑後隱藏環境事件。驗證亦須釐清下列替代解釋：熱折射可能使多點一致偏移，濾波後曲線更平順卻更像真實轉向；若品質旗標未傳到決策端，系統會對低可信度數值給出過度確定的判讀。","textEn":"Record visibility, temperature and tracking status and compare stable references and backup observations for common bias; survey leads determine acceptable use under approved procedures rather than smoothing environmental events out of the record. Verification must also resolve this competing explanation: Thermal refraction can shift many points together, and filtering makes the false trend resemble genuine steering. Missing quality flags cause the decision layer to treat low-confidence observations as definite positions.","sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]},{"id":"b145-v14-31-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"交接時逐項記錄折射環境與品質旗標的資料來源與適用條件。記錄可視、溫度與儀器追蹤狀態，對照穩定參考點及備援量測，判斷共模偏差；不佳品質時由測量主管依核准程序確認資料用途，不能平滑後隱藏環境事件。","textEn":"At handover, document the evidence and applicable conditions for refraction environment and quality flags. Record visibility, temperature and tracking status and compare stable references and backup observations for common bias; survey leads determine acceptable use under approved procedures rather than smoothing environmental events out of the record.","sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「折射環境與品質旗標」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Refraction environment and quality flags\"?","options":["沿用另一條隧道或另一處地層的量測結果，就可視為本工程已完成驗證。","記錄可視、溫度與儀器追蹤狀態，對照穩定參考點及備援量測，判斷共模偏差；不佳品質時由測量主管依核准程序確認資料用途，不能平滑後隱藏環境事件。","平面里程和斜距可以不加說明直接用在同一環號表。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another tunnel or ground formation counts as verifying this structure.","Record visibility, temperature and tracking status and compare stable references and backup observations for common bias.","Horizontal chainage and slope distance can be interchanged within one ring table without explanation."],"answer":1,"explanation":"記錄可視、溫度與儀器追蹤狀態，對照穩定參考點及備援量測，判斷共模偏差；不佳品質時由測量主管依核准程序確認資料用途，不能平滑後隱藏環境事件。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Record visibility, temperature and tracking status and compare stable references and backup observations for common bias; survey leads determine acceptable use under approved procedures rather than smoothing environmental events out of the record. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":31},{"id":"b145-v14-32","title":"折射環境與品質旗標：失效診斷","titleEn":"Refraction environment and quality flags: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"prerequisiteIds":["b145-v14-31"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「折射環境與品質旗標」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Refraction environment and quality flags” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"熱折射可能使多點一致偏移，濾波後曲線更平順卻更像真實轉向；若品質旗標未傳到決策端，系統會對低可信度數值給出過度確定的判讀。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Thermal refraction can shift many points together, and filtering makes the false trend resemble genuine steering. Missing quality flags cause the decision layer to treat low-confidence observations as definite positions. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：熱折射可能使多點一致偏移，濾波後曲線更平順卻更像真實轉向；若品質旗標未傳到決策端，系統會對低可信度數值給出過度確定的判讀。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Missing quality flags cause the decision layer to treat low-confidence observations as definite positions.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「把受折射影響的讀值平滑後就能恢復真實機器姿態。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Smoothing refracted observations restores the true machine attitude automatically.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b145-v14-32-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"熱折射可能使多點一致偏移，濾波後曲線更平順卻更像真實轉向；若品質旗標未傳到決策端，系統會對低可信度數值給出過度確定的判讀。","textEn":"Thermal refraction can shift many points together, and filtering makes the false trend resemble genuine steering. Missing quality flags cause the decision layer to treat low-confidence observations as definite positions.","sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]},{"id":"b145-v14-32-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「折射環境與品質旗標」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Refraction environment and quality flags\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["補一層塗料或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數劣化問題。","兩個共用錯誤基準的感測器融合後可以消除共同偏差。","熱折射可能使多點一致偏移，濾波後曲線更平順卻更像真實轉向；若品質旗標未傳到決策端，系統會對低可信度數值給出過度確定的判讀。"],"optionsEn":["Adding a coat of paint or widening the acceptance limits solves most deterioration problems.","Fusing two sensors sharing an incorrect datum eliminates their common bias.","Thermal refraction can shift many points together, and filtering makes the false trend resemble genuine steering."],"answer":2,"explanation":"熱折射可能使多點一致偏移，濾波後曲線更平順卻更像真實轉向；若品質旗標未傳到決策端，系統會對低可信度數值給出過度確定的判讀。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Thermal refraction can shift many points together, and filtering makes the false trend resemble genuine steering. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":32}],"order":4},{"id":"b145-v14-s5","title":"耐久、維護與工程交接","titleEn":"Durability, maintenance and engineering handoff","description":"本階段聚焦「資料融合與共同偏差」與「貫通檢核與竣工交接」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Data fusion and common bias\" and \"Breakthrough checks and as-built handover\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b145-v14-33","title":"資料融合與共同偏差：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Data fusion and common bias: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"prerequisiteIds":["b145-v14-32"],"objective":"說明「資料融合與共同偏差」如何影響潛盾掘進導向控制的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Data fusion and common bias” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “TBM alignment guidance and control”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"兩個獨立無偏量測可按不確定度加權降低隨機誤差，但共享控制點或相機模型時並不獨立。融合前需列出共同來源，否則算出的精度提升只是重複計算同一證據。 假設獨立標準不確定2與3 mm，融合u=1/√(1/2²+1/3²)=1.664 mm；有共同偏差時不適用。 兩套系統共用錯誤基準可精密地同意一個錯位置，融合後不確定度卻更小；將不同時刻的機位合併又會把真實運動當成量測分歧。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「資料融合與共同偏差」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Independent unbiased measurements can be weighted to reduce random error, but shared controls or geometry create dependence. Identify common sources before fusion or the apparent improvement simply counts the same evidence more than once. For assumed independent standard uncertainties 2 and 3 mm, fused u=1/√(1/2²+1/3²)=1.664 mm, inapplicable to a shared bias. Two systems sharing a wrong datum can agree precisely on the wrong position while fusion reports smaller uncertainty. Combining different epochs additionally mistakes genuine machine movement for disagreement between observations. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Data fusion and common bias” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings.","failure":"常見誤解：「兩個共用錯誤基準的感測器融合後可以消除共同偏差。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Fusing two sensors sharing an incorrect datum eliminates their common bias.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「資料融合與共同偏差」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Data fusion and common bias”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b145-v14-33-k1","title":"資料融合與共同偏差","titleEn":"Data fusion and common bias","text":"兩個獨立無偏量測可按不確定度加權降低隨機誤差，但共享控制點或相機模型時並不獨立。融合前需列出共同來源，否則算出的精度提升只是重複計算同一證據。","textEn":"Independent unbiased measurements can be weighted to reduce random error, but shared controls or geometry create dependence. Identify common sources before fusion or the apparent improvement simply counts the same evidence more than once.","sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]},{"id":"b145-v14-33-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：兩個共用錯誤基準的感測器融合後可以消除共同偏差。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Fusing two sensors sharing an incorrect datum eliminates their common bias. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「資料融合與共同偏差」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Data fusion and common bias\" is correct?","options":["兩個獨立無偏量測可按不確定度加權降低隨機誤差，但共享控制點或相機模型時並不獨立。","兩個共用錯誤基準的感測器融合後可以消除共同偏差。","事後強制閉合差歸零，就不需要再保存原始貫通誤差。"],"optionsEn":["Independent unbiased measurements can be weighted to reduce random error, but shared controls or geometry create dependence.","Fusing two sensors sharing an incorrect datum eliminates their common bias.","Forcing closure to zero afterward removes any need to retain the original breakthrough discrepancy."],"answer":0,"explanation":"兩個獨立無偏量測可按不確定度加權降低隨機誤差，但共享控制點或相機模型時並不獨立。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Independent unbiased measurements can be weighted to reduce random error, but shared controls or geometry create dependence. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":33},{"id":"b145-v14-34","title":"資料融合與共同偏差：定量估算","titleEn":"Data fusion and common bias: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"prerequisiteIds":["b145-v14-33"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「資料融合與共同偏差」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Data fusion and common bias” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。假設獨立標準不確定2與3 mm，融合u=1/√(1/2²+1/3²)=1.664 mm；有共同偏差時不適用。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings. For assumed independent standard uncertainties 2 and 3 mm, fused u=1/√(1/2²+1/3²)=1.664 mm, inapplicable to a shared bias. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：繪製各感測器到坐標基準的依賴圖，檢查共同校準和時間戳，使用未參與融合的控制點驗證；演算法負責人保留權重與異常剔除紀錄，不以多感測器數量宣稱獨立性。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Map dependencies from sensors to datum, checking shared calibration and clocks and validating against unused controls; algorithm owners retain weights and rejection records rather than asserting independence from sensor count alone.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b145-v14-34-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。假設獨立標準不確定2與3 mm，融合u=1/√(1/2²+1/3²)=1.664 mm；有共同偏差時不適用。","textEn":"The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings. For assumed independent standard uncertainties 2 and 3 mm, fused u=1/√(1/2²+1/3²)=1.664 mm, inapplicable to a shared bias.","sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]},{"id":"b145-v14-34-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「資料融合與共同偏差」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Data fusion and common bias\", which statement holds?","options":["每一測段的角度誤差必定獨立而且可以互相抵消。","以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。","從目標點算刀盤中心只需平移，不必考慮機身旋轉。"],"optionsEn":["Angular errors in every survey segment are necessarily independent and cancel each other.","The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings.","Transforming a target to cutterhead center requires translation only, without machine rotation."],"answer":1,"explanation":"以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":34},{"id":"b145-v14-35","title":"資料融合與共同偏差：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Data fusion and common bias: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"prerequisiteIds":["b145-v14-34"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「資料融合與共同偏差」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Data fusion and common bias” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"繪製各感測器到坐標基準的依賴圖，檢查共同校準和時間戳，使用未參與融合的控制點驗證；演算法負責人保留權重與異常剔除紀錄，不以多感測器數量宣稱獨立性。驗證亦須釐清下列替代解釋：兩套系統共用錯誤基準可精密地同意一個錯位置，融合後不確定度卻更小；將不同時刻的機位合併又會把真實運動當成量測分歧。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Map dependencies from sensors to datum, checking shared calibration and clocks and validating against unused controls; algorithm owners retain weights and rejection records rather than asserting independence from sensor count alone. Verification must also resolve this competing explanation: Two systems sharing a wrong datum can agree precisely on the wrong position while fusion reports smaller uncertainty. Combining different epochs additionally mistakes genuine machine movement for disagreement between observations. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：交接時逐項記錄資料融合與共同偏差的資料來源與適用條件。繪製各感測器到坐標基準的依賴圖，檢查共同校準和時間戳，使用未參與融合的控制點驗證；演算法負責人保留權重與異常剔除紀錄，不以多感測器數量宣稱獨立性。","observationEn":"Site practice: At handover, document the evidence and applicable conditions for data fusion and common bias. Map dependencies from sensors to datum, checking shared calibration and clocks and validating against unused controls; algorithm owners retain weights and rejection records rather than asserting independence from sensor count alone.","failure":"注意干擾：兩套系統共用錯誤基準可精密地同意一個錯位置，融合後不確定度卻更小；將不同時刻的機位合併又會把真實運動當成量測分歧。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Two systems sharing a wrong datum can agree precisely on the wrong position while fusion reports smaller uncertainty. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b145-v14-35-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"繪製各感測器到坐標基準的依賴圖，檢查共同校準和時間戳，使用未參與融合的控制點驗證；演算法負責人保留權重與異常剔除紀錄，不以多感測器數量宣稱獨立性。驗證亦須釐清下列替代解釋：兩套系統共用錯誤基準可精密地同意一個錯位置，融合後不確定度卻更小；將不同時刻的機位合併又會把真實運動當成量測分歧。","textEn":"Map dependencies from sensors to datum, checking shared calibration and clocks and validating against unused controls; algorithm owners retain weights and rejection records rather than asserting independence from sensor count alone. Verification must also resolve this competing explanation: Two systems sharing a wrong datum can agree precisely on the wrong position while fusion reports smaller uncertainty. Combining different epochs additionally mistakes genuine machine movement for disagreement between observations.","sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]},{"id":"b145-v14-35-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"交接時逐項記錄資料融合與共同偏差的資料來源與適用條件。繪製各感測器到坐標基準的依賴圖，檢查共同校準和時間戳，使用未參與融合的控制點驗證；演算法負責人保留權重與異常剔除紀錄，不以多感測器數量宣稱獨立性。","textEn":"At handover, document the evidence and applicable conditions for data fusion and common bias. Map dependencies from sensors to datum, checking shared calibration and clocks and validating against unused controls; algorithm owners retain weights and rejection records rather than asserting independence from sensor count alone.","sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「資料融合與共同偏差」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Data fusion and common bias\"?","options":["只看一次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準點、參考試體或重複量測。","只要能回到設計中心線，就不必檢查組環曲率與止水限制。","繪製各感測器到坐標基準的依賴圖，檢查共同校準和時間戳，使用未參與融合的控制點驗證；演算法負責人保留權重與異常剔除紀錄，不以多感測器數量宣稱獨立性。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the work; no datum, reference specimen or repeat measurement is needed.","Returning to the design centerline removes the need to check ring curvature and seal limits.","Map dependencies from sensors to datum, checking shared calibration and clocks and validating against unused controls."],"answer":2,"explanation":"繪製各感測器到坐標基準的依賴圖，檢查共同校準和時間戳，使用未參與融合的控制點驗證；演算法負責人保留權重與異常剔除紀錄，不以多感測器數量宣稱獨立性。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Map dependencies from sensors to datum, checking shared calibration and clocks and validating against unused controls; algorithm owners retain weights and rejection records rather than asserting independence from sensor count alone. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":35},{"id":"b145-v14-36","title":"資料融合與共同偏差：失效診斷","titleEn":"Data fusion and common bias: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"prerequisiteIds":["b145-v14-35"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「資料融合與共同偏差」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Data fusion and common bias” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"兩套系統共用錯誤基準可精密地同意一個錯位置，融合後不確定度卻更小；將不同時刻的機位合併又會把真實運動當成量測分歧。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Two systems sharing a wrong datum can agree precisely on the wrong position while fusion reports smaller uncertainty. Combining different epochs additionally mistakes genuine machine movement for disagreement between observations. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：兩套系統共用錯誤基準可精密地同意一個錯位置，融合後不確定度卻更小；將不同時刻的機位合併又會把真實運動當成量測分歧。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Combining different epochs additionally mistakes genuine machine movement for disagreement between observations.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「兩個共用錯誤基準的感測器融合後可以消除共同偏差。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Fusing two sensors sharing an incorrect datum eliminates their common bias.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b145-v14-36-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"兩套系統共用錯誤基準可精密地同意一個錯位置，融合後不確定度卻更小；將不同時刻的機位合併又會把真實運動當成量測分歧。","textEn":"Two systems sharing a wrong datum can agree precisely on the wrong position while fusion reports smaller uncertainty. Combining different epochs additionally mistakes genuine machine movement for disagreement between observations.","sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]},{"id":"b145-v14-36-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「資料融合與共同偏差」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Data fusion and common bias\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["兩套系統共用錯誤基準可精密地同意一個錯位置，融合後不確定度卻更小；將不同時刻的機位合併又會把真實運動當成量測分歧。","裂縫或異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","事後強制閉合差歸零，就不需要再保存原始貫通誤差。"],"optionsEn":["Two systems sharing a wrong datum can agree precisely on the wrong position while fusion reports smaller uncertainty.","A crack or anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","Forcing closure to zero afterward removes any need to retain the original breakthrough discrepancy."],"answer":0,"explanation":"兩套系統共用錯誤基準可精密地同意一個錯位置，融合後不確定度卻更小；將不同時刻的機位合併又會把真實運動當成量測分歧。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Two systems sharing a wrong datum can agree precisely on the wrong position while fusion reports smaller uncertainty. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":36},{"id":"b145-v14-37","title":"貫通檢核與竣工交接：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Breakthrough checks and as-built handover: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"prerequisiteIds":["b145-v14-36"],"objective":"說明「貫通檢核與竣工交接」如何影響潛盾掘進導向控制的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Breakthrough checks and as-built handover” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “TBM alignment guidance and control”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"導航完整性最後需由獨立控制和竣工幾何驗證，閉合差是整條量測鏈的結果而非某台儀器單獨績效。交接保存設計線、實際環片和機器歷程，讓誤差來源可分辨並供後續淨空與維護使用。 假設獨立零均值橫向隨機誤差的標準不確定度分量10、12、9 mm，RSS=√(100+144+81)=18.03 mm；系統偏差另列。 事後強制平差到零會抹去真實閉合證據，若不保留原始值就無法辨識施工偏差與測量偏差；未交環片實際幾何也會影響營運淨空判斷。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「貫通檢核與竣工交接」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Independent control and as-built geometry ultimately verify navigation. Closure reflects the whole measurement chain, not one instrument's performance. Preserve design, installed rings and machine history for error diagnosis, clearance assessment and future maintenance. Assume standard-uncertainty components of independent zero-mean lateral errors of 10,12 and 9 mm; RSS=√(100+144+81)=18.03 mm, with systematic biases reported separately. Forcing closure to zero afterward erases evidence unless raw observations are retained, preventing separation of construction and survey error. Missing installed-ring geometry also undermines operational clearance assessment after handover. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Breakthrough checks and as-built handover” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings.","failure":"常見誤解：「事後強制閉合差歸零，就不需要再保存原始貫通誤差。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Forcing closure to zero afterward removes any need to retain the original breakthrough discrepancy.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「貫通檢核與竣工交接」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Breakthrough checks and as-built handover”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b145-v14-37-k1","title":"貫通檢核與竣工交接","titleEn":"Breakthrough checks and as-built handover","text":"導航完整性最後需由獨立控制和竣工幾何驗證，閉合差是整條量測鏈的結果而非某台儀器單獨績效。交接保存設計線、實際環片和機器歷程，讓誤差來源可分辨並供後續淨空與維護使用。","textEn":"Independent control and as-built geometry ultimately verify navigation. Closure reflects the whole measurement chain, not one instrument's performance.","sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]},{"id":"b145-v14-37-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：事後強制閉合差歸零，就不需要再保存原始貫通誤差。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Forcing closure to zero afterward removes any need to retain the original breakthrough discrepancy. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「貫通檢核與竣工交接」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Breakthrough checks and as-built handover\" is correct?","options":["事後強制閉合差歸零，就不需要再保存原始貫通誤差。","導航完整性最後需由獨立控制和竣工幾何驗證，閉合差是整條量測鏈的結果而非某台儀器單獨績效。","坐標原點重合就保證整條長隧道的尺度與旋轉都正確。"],"optionsEn":["Forcing closure to zero afterward removes any need to retain the original breakthrough discrepancy.","Independent control and as-built geometry ultimately verify navigation.","Coincident coordinate origins guarantee correct scale and rotation along the entire long tunnel."],"answer":1,"explanation":"導航完整性最後需由獨立控制和竣工幾何驗證，閉合差是整條量測鏈的結果而非某台儀器單獨績效。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Independent control and as-built geometry ultimately verify navigation. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":37},{"id":"b145-v14-38","title":"貫通檢核與竣工交接：定量估算","titleEn":"Breakthrough checks and as-built handover: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"prerequisiteIds":["b145-v14-37"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「貫通檢核與竣工交接」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Breakthrough checks and as-built handover” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。假設獨立零均值橫向隨機誤差的標準不確定度分量10、12、9 mm，RSS=√(100+144+81)=18.03 mm；系統偏差另列。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings. Assume standard-uncertainty components of independent zero-mean lateral errors of 10,12 and 9 mm; RSS=√(100+144+81)=18.03 mm, with systematic biases reported separately. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：以不共享全部基準的獨立測網檢查貫通與竣工線形，追查閉合差的方向及沿程分布；測量、設計及業主共同確認未解決偏差、資料版本與適用精度，不能只交單一最終座標。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Check breakthrough and as-built alignment with an independently constrained network and examine closure direction and distribution; survey, design and owner leads accept remaining deviations, versions and accuracy limits rather than receiving only one final coordinate.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b145-v14-38-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。假設獨立零均值橫向隨機誤差的標準不確定度分量10、12、9 mm，RSS=√(100+144+81)=18.03 mm；系統偏差另列。","textEn":"The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings. Assume standard-uncertainty components of independent zero-mean lateral errors of 10,12 and 9 mm; RSS=√(100+144+81)=18.03 mm, with systematic biases reported separately.","sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]},{"id":"b145-v14-38-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「貫通檢核與竣工交接」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Breakthrough checks and as-built handover\", which statement holds?","options":["陀螺方向是自動真值，不需再校準或考慮溫度漂移。","平面里程和斜距可以不加說明直接用在同一環號表。","以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。"],"optionsEn":["Gyro orientation is automatic truth needing no calibration or thermal-drift consideration.","Horizontal chainage and slope distance can be interchanged within one ring table without explanation.","The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings."],"answer":2,"explanation":"以下為教學假設，非現場操作設定。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"The following are teaching assumptions, not field operating settings. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":38},{"id":"b145-v14-39","title":"貫通檢核與竣工交接：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Breakthrough checks and as-built handover: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"prerequisiteIds":["b145-v14-38"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「貫通檢核與竣工交接」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Breakthrough checks and as-built handover” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"以不共享全部基準的獨立測網檢查貫通與竣工線形，追查閉合差的方向及沿程分布；測量、設計及業主共同確認未解決偏差、資料版本與適用精度，不能只交單一最終座標。驗證亦須釐清下列替代解釋：事後強制平差到零會抹去真實閉合證據，若不保留原始值就無法辨識施工偏差與測量偏差；未交環片實際幾何也會影響營運淨空判斷。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Check breakthrough and as-built alignment with an independently constrained network and examine closure direction and distribution; survey, design and owner leads accept remaining deviations, versions and accuracy limits rather than receiving only one final coordinate. Verification must also resolve this competing explanation: Forcing closure to zero afterward erases evidence unless raw observations are retained, preventing separation of construction and survey error. Missing installed-ring geometry also undermines operational clearance assessment after handover. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：交接時逐項記錄貫通檢核與竣工交接的資料來源與適用條件。以不共享全部基準的獨立測網檢查貫通與竣工線形，追查閉合差的方向及沿程分布；測量、設計及業主共同確認未解決偏差、資料版本與適用精度，不能只交單一最終座標。","observationEn":"Site practice: At handover, document the evidence and applicable conditions for breakthrough checks and as-built handover. Check breakthrough and as-built alignment with an independently constrained network and examine closure direction and distribution; survey, design and owner leads accept remaining deviations, versions and accuracy limits rather than receiving only one final coordinate.","failure":"注意干擾：事後強制平差到零會抹去真實閉合證據，若不保留原始值就無法辨識施工偏差與測量偏差；未交環片實際幾何也會影響營運淨空判斷。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Forcing closure to zero afterward erases evidence unless raw observations are retained, preventing separation of construction and survey error. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b145-v14-39-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以不共享全部基準的獨立測網檢查貫通與竣工線形，追查閉合差的方向及沿程分布；測量、設計及業主共同確認未解決偏差、資料版本與適用精度，不能只交單一最終座標。驗證亦須釐清下列替代解釋：事後強制平差到零會抹去真實閉合證據，若不保留原始值就無法辨識施工偏差與測量偏差；未交環片實際幾何也會影響營運淨空判斷。","textEn":"Check breakthrough and as-built alignment with an independently constrained network and examine closure direction and distribution; survey, design and owner leads accept remaining deviations, versions and accuracy limits rather than receiving only one final coordinate. Verification must also resolve this competing explanation: Forcing closure to zero afterward erases evidence unless raw observations are retained, preventing separation of construction and survey error. Missing installed-ring geometry also undermines operational clearance assessment after handover.","sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]},{"id":"b145-v14-39-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"交接時逐項記錄貫通檢核與竣工交接的資料來源與適用條件。以不共享全部基準的獨立測網檢查貫通與竣工線形，追查閉合差的方向及沿程分布；測量、設計及業主共同確認未解決偏差、資料版本與適用精度，不能只交單一最終座標。","textEn":"At handover, document the evidence and applicable conditions for breakthrough checks and as-built handover. Check breakthrough and as-built alignment with an independently constrained network and examine closure direction and distribution; survey, design and owner leads accept remaining deviations, versions and accuracy limits rather than receiving only one final coordinate.","sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「貫通檢核與竣工交接」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Breakthrough checks and as-built handover\"?","options":["以不共享全部基準的獨立測網檢查貫通與竣工線形，追查閉合差的方向及沿程分布；測量、設計及業主共同確認未解決偏差、資料版本與適用精度，不能只交單一最終座標。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","刀盤在設計線上就代表盾尾與已安裝環片必定同心。"],"optionsEn":["Check breakthrough and as-built alignment with an independently constrained network and examine closure direction and distribution.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","A cutterhead on the design alignment guarantees concentric shield tail and installed rings."],"answer":0,"explanation":"以不共享全部基準的獨立測網檢查貫通與竣工線形，追查閉合差的方向及沿程分布；測量、設計及業主共同確認未解決偏差、資料版本與適用精度，不能只交單一最終座標。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Check breakthrough and as-built alignment with an independently constrained network and examine closure direction and distribution; survey, design and owner leads accept remaining deviations, versions and accuracy limits rather than receiving only one final coordinate. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":39},{"id":"b145-v14-40","title":"貫通檢核與竣工交接：失效診斷","titleEn":"Breakthrough checks and as-built handover: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"prerequisiteIds":["b145-v14-39"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「貫通檢核與竣工交接」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Breakthrough checks and as-built handover” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"事後強制平差到零會抹去真實閉合證據，若不保留原始值就無法辨識施工偏差與測量偏差；未交環片實際幾何也會影響營運淨空判斷。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Forcing closure to zero afterward erases evidence unless raw observations are retained, preventing separation of construction and survey error. Missing installed-ring geometry also undermines operational clearance assessment after handover. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：事後強制平差到零會抹去真實閉合證據，若不保留原始值就無法辨識施工偏差與測量偏差；未交環片實際幾何也會影響營運淨空判斷。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Missing installed-ring geometry also undermines operational clearance assessment after handover.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「事後強制閉合差歸零，就不需要再保存原始貫通誤差。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Forcing closure to zero afterward removes any need to retain the original breakthrough discrepancy.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b145-v14-40-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"事後強制平差到零會抹去真實閉合證據，若不保留原始值就無法辨識施工偏差與測量偏差；未交環片實際幾何也會影響營運淨空判斷。","textEn":"Forcing closure to zero afterward erases evidence unless raw observations are retained, preventing separation of construction and survey error. Missing installed-ring geometry also undermines operational clearance assessment after handover.","sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]},{"id":"b145-v14-40-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「貫通檢核與竣工交接」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Breakthrough checks and as-built handover\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的構件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","事後強制平差到零會抹去真實閉合證據，若不保留原始值就無法辨識施工偏差與測量偏差；未交環片實際幾何也會影響營運淨空判斷。","坐標原點重合就保證整條長隧道的尺度與旋轉都正確。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive component first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","Forcing closure to zero afterward erases evidence unless raw observations are retained, preventing separation of construction and survey error.","Coincident coordinate origins guarantee correct scale and rotation along the entire long tunnel."],"answer":1,"explanation":"事後強制平差到零會抹去真實閉合證據，若不保留原始值就無法辨識施工偏差與測量偏差；未交環片實際幾何也會影響營運淨空判斷。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Forcing closure to zero afterward erases evidence unless raw observations are retained, preventing separation of construction and survey error. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":40}],"order":5}],"sourceIds":["v14s-vmt-navigation","v14s-amberg-survey","v14s-fhwa","v14s-crossrail-geology","v7-gotthard-network"],"curriculumVersion":14,"stepCount":40,"estimatedMinutes":1000}};
